<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">MAT-NGINDO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matayo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na Matayo nga gumwe kati ja itabu ncheche Mulilagano Liyono yenie ilanduli kutama kwa Yesu Kilisto padunia. Kila kitabu kikemigwa, “Injili” mana gakwe, “Nhwalo Gwambone.” Yenie iandikigwa kuboka pukujomoka Yesu, uandikigwa na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana. Akachomi bamanyi kipolaje chaka chuandikigwa nhwalo gwambone gwa Matayo, bapemelelanga pangaje uandikigwa chaka cha 60 kuboka pukubelekwa Kilisto. Uyo bamanyije paali puandikigwa, nambu ajingi baachanga gwenio uandikigwa ku Palestina andaje ku kilambo chuku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhwandiki Matayo ojwakiba ntocha kodi, tango nu kupambuligwaje na Yesu kube napunji jwakwe. Uyo amanyikana ku liina lya Lawi. Matayo akiba jumwe kati ja achandundame komi na abena na baandakila akachomi biki Yahudi. Ganga gabonekana kipola gambu gwatumi majandiko kupeta 60 kuboke mu lilagano lya lolo. Apala kulaya kutenda Yesu nga Masia, Nkomboi jwenio nga ojwalondoligwa na akalondoli. Kabe Matayo alongi kipola muno kukulenga kingwana cha uhuke jwa Nnoongo Akayahudi bayobalela kutenda Masia akaba nngwana jwa chilikali padunia. Matayo alanduli kipola kukana mawacho genia nu kulaya kingwana chu uhuke cha Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Matayo nga kitabu chu kualala kutumbu mu Nhwalo Gwambone gambu gwa mapungu gakwe goa agatumike kuboka Majandiko ga lolo. Genia galonda Malagano mabena. Akachomi balenga Matayo ajigite kengama andi pikibi kitabu cha Musa, chenie nga kitabu chukutumbula mu Lilagano lya Lolo. Matangacho ga Yesu ga pikitombi (Matayo lipungu lya 5-7). Gawechi kulandanikigwa na chalia ja Nnoongo jampa Musa (Kombake Tolati 19:3-23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Matayo mu kitabu chakwe atumbwi kulenga nhwalo gu kubelekwa kwa Yesu Kilisto na atumbwi na kulenga nhwalo gu liengo lyakwe mulipungu lya 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe Matayo alengite kipola nhwalo gwa liengo lya Yesu nu kubola kwakwe kwoa mulipungu lya 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">Matayo ajomole kitabu chakwe kukulanduli panakati ji liengo lya Yesu mu kiu chakwe nu kuyoka kwakwe (Lipungu lya 26-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lungolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lungolo lwa Yesu Kilisto, kibelei cha Daudi, ngi kibelei chu Ulaimu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kuboka pu Ulaimu kuika Nngwana Daudi, yenje ngi ibelei yenie, Ulaimu ngapoto mwana Isaka, Isaka ngapoto mwana Yakobo, Yakobo ngapoto mwana Yuda, ni inunu yakwe,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yuda ngapoto mwana Felisi na Zela amamundu bakiba Atamali, Pelisi ngapoto mwana Esiloni, Esiloni ngapoto mwana Lami. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lami ngapoto mwana Aminadabu, Aminadabu ngapoto mwana Nashoni na Nashoni ngapoto na mwana selemani, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Selemani ngapoto mwana Boazi amamundu Laabu. Boazi ngapoto mwana Obedi amamundu Lutu, Boazi na Lutu bakibanga achikibelei ba Obedi, Obedi ngapoto mwana Yese, <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yese nga ngapoto mwana Nngwana Daudi. Daudi ngapoto mwana Solomoni amamundu abakiba anaba Uliya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Solomoni ngapoto mwana Leoboamu, Leoboamu ngapoto mwana Abiya. Abiya ngapoto mwana Asa, <verse number="8" style="v"/>Asa ngapoto mwana Yaashafati, Yaashafati ngapoto mwana Yolamu, Yolamu ngapoto mwana Uzia, <verse number="9" style="v"/>Uzia ngapoto mwana Yotamu, Yotamu ngabe na mwana, Aazi ngapoto mwana Ezekia. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ezekia ngapoto mwana Manase, Manase ngapoto mwana Amoni, Amoni ngapoto mwana Yosea. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yosea ngapoto mwana Yekonia, na akanung'una. Kingobu chenie kikiba kiamo Akayahudi kapeleka kukilambo chuku Babiloni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuboka pikitamo cha Akayahudi kujenda ku Babiloni, Yekonia ngapoto mwana Shetieli, Shetieli ngapoto mwana Zelubabeli. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Zelubabeli ngapoto mwana Abiudi, Abiudi ngapoto mwana Eliakimu, Eliakimu ngapoto mwana Azoli. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Azoli ngapoto mwana Sadoki, Sadoki ngapoto mwana Akimu, Akimu ngapoto mwana Eliudi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Eliudi ngapoto mwana Eliazeli, Eliazeli ngapoto mwana Matani, Matani ngapoto mwana Yakobo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yakobo ngapoto mwana Yusufu, ojwakiba angwana ba Maliamu amama ba Yesu ojwakonda Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Penia ikapeta ibelei komi na ncheche kuboka pu Ulaimu mpaka Daudi, ni ibelei komi na ncheche kuboka pa Daudi mpaka pa Akayahudi pabatoligwa ubanda Kujenda ku Babiloni, ni ibelei komi na ncheche kuboka pabatoligwa ubanda kuika kingobu cha Kilisto Nkomboi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubelekwa kwa Yesu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kubelekwa kwa Yesu Kilisto kukiba yene, Maliamu amamundu Yesu akankobeka Yusufu. Nambu tangu nu kutamangaje pamwe andi pibi analome na akege, Maliamu ngabonekana abi na ndumbo kuwecho gwa Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Magambu Yusufu akiba na majendo ga mbone nnongi ja Nnoongo, apaije kunkoya oni Maliamu, ngapala kunneka kukunyegela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pakiba akaacha genia Mpakachi jwa Angwana kuboka Kumbengu ngampitila mumaloto kulenga, “Yusufu, mwana jwa Daudi, makajobokaje kuntola Maliamu kube aanabinu magambu ndumbo ejabinajo kuwecho gwa Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Abakupoto mwana munalome mumpa liina lyakwe Yesu, magambu jwenio nga ojwapakakombola bandu bakwe mumabaja gabe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Genia goa gapitila lilenganile lilobe lya Angwana elibalenga kupete nnondoli jwa Nnoongo, <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Munkege jwangamanya analome aiba na ndumbo apotola mwana munalome, nangweto binkema Imanueli” kulenga, “Nnoongo abi pamwe natwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yusufu apajimuka mulugono, ngatenda genia agalenga mpakachi jwa Angwana kuboka Kumbengu, nganto Maliamu kube aanamundu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nambu bagolokingeje kindanda chimweje mpaka Maliamu apapotola mwana munalome Yusufu ngampe liina mwana jwenio Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Akageni kuboka kumbwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu abelekwa kukilambo chuku Beteleemu kunkoa gwa Kuyudea, kingobu Helode pakiba Nngwana. Kingobu tu kuboka pu kubelekwa, akamanyi ba ndondwa ngabaika Kuyelusalemu kuboka kumbwani. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngabakonya, “Kibiko kilemba, chikibelwike ojwabakube Nngwana jwa Akayahudi? Tulubweni lutondwa lwakwe kuboka kumbwani natwe tuikita kunng'ongalela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nngwana Helode pajoa genia, ngaechuka muno pamwe na boa abatama Kuyelusalemu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Helode ngabakemanga akakolongwa ba Akakung'i boa na akaboli ba malagilo ga Musa, ngabakonyanga, “Kilisto Nkomboi apakubelekwa koo?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Angweto ngabajanga, “Apakubelekwa kukilambo chuku Beteleemu, nkoa gwa Yudea. Andi piandikigwe na nnondoli jwa Nnoongo,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>‘Mwe Beteleemu kilambo cha Kuyuda,</para>
  <para style="q">mwe machokochokoje panakati ji ilambo Ikuyuda,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu kwinu apakupiti kilongoi</para>
  <para style="q">ojwapakalongaleya bandu bango, bu Kuisilaeli.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Penia Helode ngabakemanga pantemela akamanyi ba ndondwa, ngaba konyanga kingobu gani pulupitila lutondwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngabatuma bajendange ku Beteleemu ngabalagi, “Nnyendange makaingikiye nhwalo gwa mwana jwenio, anda mampatite unetele nhwalo gwenio nane nyende nakang'ongalele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuboka pa kapenikia angwana, akamanyi ba ndondwa ngabajabula. Penia lutondwa lubalubona kingono cha kalelo kumbwani ngulwalongaleya mpaka ngulujenda kujema panani pakiba mwana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pubulubona lutondwa lwenio ngabaala mwojo muno. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ngabajingila unyumba ngabammona mwana jwenio pamwe na amamundu Amaliamu, ngabakilikitila, ngabanng'ongalela. Kuboka penia ngabakulugula mikoba jabe ngabampe hupo, jaabu nu ubani na mauta ga bei ngolongwa agakemigwa manemane.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Penia ngababuja kachabe kundela jenge gambu Nnoongo akatekakelebuya mumaloto bakammujije Helode.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutili kukilambo cha Kumisili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuboka pa akageni kujabula, mpakachi jwa Angwana kuboka kumbengu ngampitila Yusufu mumaloto ngannenge, “Nnyimuke muntole mwana pamwe na amamundu ntilile kukilambo cha Kumisili. Ntamanga kwenio mpaka pambakunnengela, gambu Helode apa kunkoma mwana jwenio.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yene Yusufu ngajimuka, ngantola mwana na amamundu, ngababokanga kilo kujenda Kumisili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngabatama kwenio mpaka Helode pajomokaga. Kilebe chenie kipitila kupala lilobe libalongela Angwana kupete nnondoli jwa Nnoongo lilenganile, “Nganankema manango kuboka Kumisili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukomigwa kwa ilemba ikinalome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Helode apang'anyama kutenda akamanyi ba ndondwa bala batekunkoloya, ngachimwa muno. Ngalagi ingota yoa ikinalome ya kilambo chuku Beteleemu na eibi papipi jakwe eibi nayaka ibena kubuja unyuma ikomigwe. Atenda genia akombakela machoba kuboka pagaika akamanyi ba ndondwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yene nga pagalenganila malobe agalenga Nnondoli jwa Nnoongo Yelemia,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Lilobe lijoanika kukilambo chuku Lama</para>
  <para style="q">nguto nukokaleka muno.</para>
  <para style="q">Laeli aiguti ingota yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q">na apaije kumpembeleya,</para>
  <para style="q">magambu yoa ijomwike.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubuja Kumisili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuboka pu kujomoka Helode, Mpakachi jwa Angwana kuboka kumbengu ngampiti Yusufu mumaloto ukwako Kumisili. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngannenge, “Nyimuke muntole mwana na amamundu mmuje kukilambo cha Kuisilaeli, magambu abapalangita kunkoma mwana jwenio bawilangite.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yusufu ngajimuka ngantola mwana pamwe na amamundu ngababuja kukilambo chuku Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nambu Yusufu pajoa kita Akelao Atawala Kuyudea paali pa awamundu Helode, ngajoboka kujenda kwenio. Kuboka pukunkelebuya mumaloto, ngajenda kunkoa guku Galilaya, <verse number="23" style="v"/>Na ngaami kukilambo chi Kunazaleti. Yene ngagalenganila malobe agalenga Nnondoli jwa Nnoongo, “Binkema Nnazaleti.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutangacha kwa Yohana Mmatichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Machoba genia Yohana Mmatichi ngapitila papongoti kukilambo cha Kuyudea ngatumbu katangachi bandu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngalenga, “Nnapange mabaja ginu. Magambu Kingwana chu kumbengu kibandakile!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yohana jwenio, nga ojwannenga Isaya ojwakiba nnondoli jwa Nnoongo apalenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mundu achobe papongoti kanonoya kulenga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mapanganakie Angwana ndela jabe,</para>
  <para style="q">mmeke kipola ndela jabe!’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohana akwinda ngobo ejilokigwe namajuni ga nyama ojwakemigwa ngamia, nu luunga lu limbendela akwinda mukibuno chakwe, chakulya chakwe kikiba maige na buchi gu kupongoti. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bandu kuboka kukilambo cha Kuyelusalemu nu Kuyudea, ni ilambo yoa ibi umbwega ju lukemba lwa Yolidani ngabannyendelela. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ngabalapanga mabaja gabe, na jwenio ngababatichanga mulukemba lwa Yolidani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu Yohana pababonanga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo ajingi bukunhwikalila kupala babatichigwe, ngalenga, “Mangweto machamajoka! Beneke abannengi nhwotwi kujepa lilaka lya Nnoongo eliika? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ntendange agalaya kutenda nnapangite mabaja. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Makaachangaje kutenda nhwotwile kujepa lilaka kukuneme, ‘Awabito ana Ulaimu.’ Nannenge Nnoongo aotwi kagatenda mabwe aga gabe ingota yu Ulaimu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Libago libekigwe pamanhina ga mikongo, kila nkongo gwangapambika ubakupenguligwa nu kuleke pamwoto. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nenga nammatichanga kwa mache kulaya nnapangite mabaja ginu. Nambu ojwapakuika kuboka pangunenga akweti uwecho muno kumbeta ne, nenga kuotoje kupoto ilatu yakwe. Jwenio ammatichanga kwa Uhuke jwa Chwapi na kwa mwoto. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Jwenio akamwi kipalwe chakwe chukupete mapemba. Aikongola mapemba nukubeka mukikokwe, nambu mapoi aitinia mwoto gwangaimika.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubatichigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuboka penie Yesu ngaboka kukilambo chuku Galilaya ngaika mulukemba lwa Yolidani, kupala abatichigwe na Yohana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu Yohana ngatumbu kunkanalila kulenga, nenga mbaligwa kubatichigwa na mwenga, “Lele, mwe nhwika kwango nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngannyanga, “Ngoe magaleke genia gabe yene. Gambu genia nga agapala Nnoongo.” Penia Yohana ngajeketela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuboka pa Yesu kubatichigwa, ngapita umache. Kingobu ucho mbengu ngijiekuka, ngammona Uhuke jwa Nnoongo akauluka anda ngunda nukutola panani jakwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lilobe kuboka kumbengu, ngililenga, “Jwenio nga manango, junampala jwanhalalila.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutegigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maluko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Uhuke jwa Chwapi ngannongaleya Yesu mpaka kupongoti kupala alondoigwe na Mmaja. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngapunga machoba alubaini kilo na mui pangalye kilebe chachoa pajomola ngajijoa njala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mmaja nganhwikalila, ngannenge, “Anda mwenga Mamwana ba Nnoongo, magaamuliche mabwe aga gabe mikate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngajanga, “Iandikigwe Mumajandiko Gachwapi,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mundu alama kukulye nkate tuje,</para>
  <para style="q">nambu ku kila lilobe elyalonge Nnoongo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Mmaja ngantola Yesu mpaka kukilambo chu Kuyelusalemu, Kilambo cha Chwapi, ngammeka kunani pulengo gwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ngannenge, “Anda mwe Mamwana ba Nnoongo mikileke pae gambu andikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q">Nnoongo maamulicha akapakachi bakwe kuboka kumbengu kwa magambu ginumwe,</para>
  <para style="q">mabannyanganga kumaboko gabe,</para>
  <para style="q">kata mukikipotekaje mumaganga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kwa magambu genia Yesu ngajanga kulenga, uyo Mumajandiko Gachwapi, iandikigwe, “Makategaje Angwana ana Nnoongo binu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Mmaja ngantola Yesu mpaka kunani kukitombi kitandamau, ngannaya kingwana chi ilambo yoa ya padunia na gwambone gwakwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mmaja ngannenge, “Yenie yoa nhotwi kumpe mwe anda nkilakatile nu kung'ongalela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngannenge, “Nnyabule mwe Malichetani! Iandikigwe Mumajandiko Gachwapi, ‘Magongalela Angwana ana Nnoongo binu na mabegelela benia jika jabe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Penia Mmaja nganneka Yesu, akapakachi kuboka kumbengu ngabaika ngabammegalela.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atumbu maengo gakwe Ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maluko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu pajoa kita Yohana Mmatichi bantabite mukipungo ngajenda Kugalilaya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngaboka kilambo chuku Nazaleti ngajenda kukilambo chuku Kafalanaumu, kilambo chikibi umbwega ja lilaba lya Galilaya, mumpaka gwa kilambo cha Zabuloni na Naftali, ngatama kwenio. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yene pililenganila lilobe elyalongela Nnondoli Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Kilambo chuku Zabuloni na Kilambo chuku Naftali,</para>
  <para style="q">Kujenda kubaali kwiye julukemba lwa Yolidani,</para>
  <para style="q">ku Galilaya, kilambo cha bandu banga Akayahudi!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bandu abatama pulubendu</para>
  <para style="q">bijibweni ndaa.</para>
  <para style="q">Angweto abatama miwili ja kiu,</para>
  <para style="q">Lumuli lwamulakile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuboka kingobu chenie Yesu ngatumbu kutangacha ngalenga, “Nnapange mabaja ginu, magambu Kingwana chu kumbengu kibandakile!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bakemanga akalopoi ancheche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu pakiba akatyanga umbwega ji lilaba lya Galilaya ngababona bandu abena alungolo akakoki, bandu benia bakiba Simoni ojwa konda Petulo na nnuna gwakwe Andulea bakakoka yamaki ku lipelele mulilaba. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Ungengamange nenga manammekanga mme makakoki ba bandu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kingobu tu ngabagaleka mapelele gabe ngabankengama Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pajenda nnongi kachoko ngababona bange akalongo abena, Yakobo na Yohana, ingota ya Zebedayo. Bakiba muntumbwi pamwe na awamundu Zebedayo, batendekea mapelele gabe. Yesu ngabakema, <verse number="22" style="v"/>benia kingobu tu ngubuleka ntumbwi pamwe na awamundu, ngabankengama Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu babola bandu na kalamia akatamwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngajenda kila paali mukilambo chu Kugalilaya kabolanga bandu mu nyumba ju kunng'ongale Nnoongo nu kutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone gu kingwana cha Nnoongo ngabalamia bandu itamwe yoa eibakiba nayo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nhwalo gwakwe ngujoanika mukilambo chuku Silia, akatamwe boa bina itamwe ya kila aina nu kulaga, bandu bina michepela, akatamwe kiinduindu, na bandu abakiba bapolite mibele, ngabapeleka kwa Yesu, jwenio ngabalamia boa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi ngabankengama kuboka kukilambo chuku Galilaya, kilambo echikibi ni ijiji komi, Kuyelusalemu na Kuyudea na kwie ja lukemba lwa Yolidani.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu babola bandu pikitombi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pababona bandu ajingi ngaombe pikitombi ngatama. Akinapunji bakwe ngabannyendelela, <verse number="2" style="v"/>jwombe ngatumbu kabolanga,</para>
  <para style="s">Laa ja kweli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Mbaya ababi nu uwocho muhuke,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu Kingwana chu kumbengu nga chabe!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mbaya ababi nu kuechuka,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu Nnoongo mabapembelea.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mbaya mundu jwa jali,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu mapokela malagano ga Nnoongo!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mbaya ababi na njala na nyota ju kutenda gapala Nnoongo,</para>
  <para style="q">Nnoongo mababeka bajukute!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mbaya ababi na kia,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu Nnoongo mababonela kia!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mbaya abampala Nnoongo kwa mwojo chwapi,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu mabammona Nnoongo!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mbaya akachikichani,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu bikemigwa ingota ya Nnoongo!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mbaya abapotekigwa kwa magambu gu kutenda agapala Nnoongo,</para>
  <para style="q">gambu Kingwana cha kumbengu nga chabe!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Mbaya mangweto anda bandu bantukine na bamponjite nu kunkopakeya kilebe chachoa chubaja kwa magambu gango nenga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nhwalalange mwojo nu kululuta gambu hupo inu ngolongwa kumbengu. Yene ngapaba bonelanga akalondoli ba Nnoongo abakiba tango namangweto kubeje.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwinyo nu lumuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mangweto nga mwinyo panakati ja bandu padunia. Nambu anda mwinyo uoite kulaa kwakwe ipakolelwa na nike? Kuchataje kabele, nambu kuleke panja nu kulebatigwa na bandu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Mangweto nga lumuli lwa dunia. Kilambo chikichengigwe panani pa kitombi kuotoje kukiia. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na bandu kupambaje lumuli nu kuluekelela lidebe, nambu kulubeka panani putala, kupala bamulakile bandu boa ababi unyumba. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mangweto uyo mpaka oti lumuli lwinu lumulike nnongi ja bandu, bagabone maengo ginu gabe chwapi na bakoigwe Awawa binu ababi kumbengu.</para>
  <para style="s">Malagilo ga Musa na Majandiko ga akalondoli ba Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Makakita nhikila kuboya Malagilo ga Musa na maboulo ga akalondolije. Nhikila kuboyaje, nambu nhikila kulenganakia. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli mpaka mbengu na dunia pipakupeta, napachokoje pa Malagilo ga Musa pukuboigwa, mpaka goa galenganile. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mundu jwajwoa ojwapakulemwa amuli ejibi njokochoko kupeta joa na kabola bange batendange jenia, jwenio apakube nchokochoko mukingwana chu kumbengu. Nambu jwajo ojwapakagakamula na kabola bange, jwenio apakube nkolongwa mukingwana chu kumbengu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Nannengelanga kweli nukamuje gambone gapala Nnoongo kapeta Mafalisayo na aboli ba Malagilo ga Musa, nnyingije ngu mukingwana chu kumbengu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo gi lilaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Nnyoaninge kutenda bandu ba lolo balengigwe, ‘Makakomaje! Abapakoma bapa kuhukumigwa.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nambu nenga nannenge, jwajwoa ojwapa kunchimwa nnunu gwakwe apakuhukumigwa. Ojwapa kummembula nnunu gwakwe apakuntakiana kana jumbe na ojwapa kunkema nnuna gwakwe, ‘Matokamau!’ Apaligwa kujingi mumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Anda mpelike lilumbo lya hupo linu kukitembe cha Nnoongo na penia nkombakile nnunugwinu abi na bulwa na mwenga, <verse number="24" style="v"/>mileke hupo inu pikitembe, nnyabule oti makachikachane na nnunugwinu, kuboka penia mmuje makapange hupo inu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nchikachane na mundu ojwantakiine kiti mmi undela, makajenda kanajumbe. Andaje ojwantakiine apakunkamuya kana akimu na akimu apa kunkamuya ku linjolinjoli na kubekigwa mukipungo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli mpitaje mwenio mpaka nnyomole kulepa uloi gwoa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo nhwalo gwa ngongola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nnyoaninge kube bandu balengigwe, ‘Makatendaje ngongola!’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu ne nannenge, ojwapa kunnolakea munkege nu kunnokolela bai ateile nakwe ngongola umwojo gwakwe. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Anda lio linu lyakalelo lipakunnyambuki kulemwa, muliboye mililekele kutali namwenga! Mbaya kuoya kipagwa chimwe cha mmele gwinu, kuliko kuoya mmele gwoa kukulekeligwa kumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Anda luboko lwinu lwa kalelo lupakunnyambukia kulemwa, mbaya muluekete mululekele kutali namwenga! Mbaya kuoya kipagwa chimwe cha mmele gwinu, kuliko mmele gwoa ujende kumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gwa kulekana mundu na anamundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Uyo ilengigwe, ‘Ojwapakaleka anamundu apaligwa kape talaka.’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu nenga nannengelanga, mundu jwajoa ojwabaleka aanamundu, nambu tu gambu ga ngongola, jwenio ammeka munkege jwenio abe nngongola na mundu anda antoi munkege jwenio atenda ngongola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo ga nhwalo gwa kulapila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kabe nyoininge kube bandu ba lolo balengaligwe, ‘Mikikilekaje channapila, nambu mpaka ntende channapile Kangwana.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nambu nenga nannenge, makalapije. Nu kumbenguje, gambu kwenio nga kukibi kitebu cha Nnoongo, <verse number="35" style="v"/>na pannemaje, gambu penia nga pukubeka makongono gabe, nuku Yelusalemuje, gambu chenie nga kilambo cha Angwana Akolongwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na makalapije kwa mutwe gwinu, gambu mwe kuotoje kulubeka lunywili lube luhu andaje lupili. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Andannengite, ‘Elo’, Ibe ‘Elo’, Anda nnengite, ‘Ije’, Ibe ‘Ije’, Chachoa chikipeta genia kiboka kwa Mmaja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo nhwalo gwa kubuyana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Ngannyoanga kube galengigwe, ‘Nnyinu anda ammoite lio namwe mammoya lio, nnyinu anda ankolite lino namwe mankola lino.’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nambu nenga nannengela, makammukije ubaja mundu mmaja. Mundu anda amputite likopi lijego lya kalelo, mantendebukie lenge. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mundu anda ampelike kamahakama kupala kutola lichati linu munnekele nilikoti linu atole. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mundu anda anhwamuliche kupotola nhwigo gwakwe mwanja gwa maili jimwe mpotola maili ibena. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ojwapakunyopa kilebe mumpe, makannyimaje ojwaika kunnyaika kilebe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo ga kapalanga akangondwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Ngannyoa kutenda ilengigwe, ‘Mumpale nndami nyinu, na manchimwe nngondwa jwinu.’ <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nambu nannenge, mapalange akangondwa binu, na majopele ku Nnoongo abampoteka, <verse number="45" style="v"/>kupala mmegange makinangota ba Awabinu ababi kumbengu. Gambu benia bamulakila lumuli lwabe bandu boa akabaja na bambone, na kakomelekea ula bandu bambone na bandu akabaja. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Bo, mpakupata upo nike ku Nnoongo, kwa kapala abampalanga mangweto tu? Magambu ata akatocha kodi bakamulanga ugo! <verse number="47" style="v"/>Anda mapatangite abali akalongo binu tu, ngimikikamwa ni kiyono? Mbone na bandu bangammanya Nnoongo bakamu ugogo! <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mmeganga makambone, anda Awabinu bu kumbengu pababi bambone!”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Maboulo ga kajangata akahocho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Ntamanga maha makakamuje itendwa yambone kupala mmonekane nnongi ja bandu. Awawa binu ababi kumbengu bampeje hupo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Pamampe kilebe nhwocho, makalandulije. Makabe mandendemunduje andi bandu ababikitenda bambone pababeganga unyumba ju kunng'ongale Nnoongo nu undela kupala bandu balumbalile. Nannenge kweli, bai bapatangite hupo yabe tegatega. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nambu mwe pamankola nhwocho wala nng'anja gwinu jwa mpalana akamanyaje panteile. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mpange kilebe chinu kukuiya na Awawa binu ba kumbengu ababibona ilebe iigwe mabampa hupo inu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo gu kugongalela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Panng'ongalela, makabeje andi bandu akandendemundu. Angweto kupala kujema munyumba ju kunng'ongale Nnoongo nu umbwega ja ndela kupala bandu babone. Nanenge kweli Angweto bapatangite hupo yabe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu mwe papakunng'ongalela Nnoongo, nnyingile kuchumbi chinu nu kujigala nniango, nng'ongalela ka Awawa binu bangabonekana. Na benia Awawa binu abagabona agaiigwe mabampa hupo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Panng'ongalela, makalonge malobe nduuje andi apabatenda bandu bangammanya Nnoongo. Magambu angweto bapemele Nnoongo jwabe bajoange gambu ga malobe gabe majingi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Makabe andi angwetoje. Gambu Awawa binu bagamanyi malola ginu tango nakajopaje. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpaligwa kugongalela yene,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Awawa bito mammi kumbengu,</para>
  <para style="q">lina linu lya chwapi likoliigwe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kingwana chinu kiike,</para>
  <para style="q">Lyampala libe kudunia andi kumbengu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mutupe lele chakulya chito.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mugalekekeye malemwa gito,</para>
  <para style="q">Andi twe putugalekekeya malemwa ga ababutulemwite.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mukutubekaje mumitambo,</para>
  <para style="q">nambu mutukombole na Mmaja.’</para>
  <para style="q">Magambu kingwana nga chinu na makakala, nu ukolongwa machoba goa pangapela. Unhyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Anda malekekiye bandu malemwa gabe, Awawa binu ba kumbengu maba nnekekeya uyo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu anda kalekekeyaje bandu malemwa gabe, na Awawa binu bannekekeyaje malemwa ginu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo ga kupunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Pampunganga, makabeje andi bandu ababikitenda bambone angweto kubeka lukenja kumio jabe babonekane na bandu bamanye kita batekupunga nannenge kweli angweto balepigwe hupo yabe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nambu mwenga, pampunga mpakala mauta umutwe jinu na nkuye kumio jinu nu kwemulila nywili inu, <verse number="18" style="v"/>ibe mundu jwajwoa akamanyaje kiti nte kupunga, imanyekane tu na Awawa binu bangabonekana. Na Awawa binu abagabona agaiigwe bampa hupo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kipato chu kumbengu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Mikikibekeje ilebe padunia, mwenio idudu na nguu kualabia na akajibi kujingila nu kujiba. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu mikibekele lupambo kumbengu kwenio idudu na nguu kuotoje kualabia, na akajibi kujingije nu kujiba. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Gambu machoba goa apulubi lupambo lwinu na mwojo gwinu uba upo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa mmele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Mio nga lumuli lwa mmele. Anda mio ginu gabi chwapi na mmele gwinu gwoa upakube mulumuli. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu anda mio ginu mabou mmele gwinu gwoa ubakube mulubendu. Bai anda lumuli olubi nkati jinu ngulubendu, mmanya lwenio ngu lubendu lukujogoya!”</para>
  <para style="s">Nnoongo na ilebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Abije mundu ojwaotwile kabegele akangwana abele. Gambu apakunchimwa jumwe nu kumpala jonge. Apakube na jumwe nu kummembu jonge. Nhwotwaje kummegelela Nnoongo nu uloi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nga kwa mana nannengelanga, makapweleje ndya nike na nywanike na wala ngobo yukwinda. Bo, bwomi gwambonije kupeta chakulya na ngobo yambone kupeta mmele? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Miloleke ijuni ikamanyai ibi kupandaje nu kuunaje, na ikwetije ikokwe. Nambu Awawa binu bu kumbengu kipe kulye. Bo mangweto mamboneje kupeta ijuni? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bene kati jinu kwa magambu ga mbwele yabe, baotwile kukijonjake kingobu chukulama pangaje lichoba limwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Kwanike kube na mbwele ya ikwindo? Magalolakeye maloba ga kamanyai pagalembulila. Gabi kamuje maengo wala kutendakea ikwindo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nambu nannengelanga, wala bene Angwana ana Solomoni pamwe nu ukolongwa gwakwe gwoa banakwindaje chwapi andi pagabi maloba aga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Anda ibi Nnoongo agakwindiya manyai ga mpongoti agabi leleno na malabo kagalekela kumwoto, bo, Nnoongo ankwindiaje mangweto muno? Makangweto mina imani njokochoko!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Makapweleje kutenda, ‘Tupakulye nike?’ Andaje ‘Tupakunywe nike?’ Andaje ‘Tupakwinda nike!’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Gambu genia goa bagabegelela bandu bangammanya Nnoongo. Awawa binu ababi kumbengu bagamanyi agampala goa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nambu ntumbu kikibegelela oti kingwana cha Nnoongo kupeta goa na agapala Nnoongo, penia Nnoongo mampage goa nu kujonjekea. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Bai, makapweleje ga malabo, gambu malabo ikweti malola gakwe. Kila lichoba likibegele lyene.”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kahukumula bange</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Makahukumuje bandu, manhwika kuhukumuligwa na Nnoongo, <verse number="2" style="v"/>gambu pamahukumula ajinu na mangweto mpakuhukumigwa uyo, ni kipemo chamapeme bange ucho echapakumpeme Nnoongo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mboni mwe milibona lipandi mulio lya nnunagwinu, na kongo lipalamandi elibi mulio linu kulibonaje? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nhwotobo kunnenge ‘Nnunu gwinu, nnyeme nammoye lipandi mulio linu na kongo mmene nkweti lipalamandi mulio linu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mwe mandendemundu! Mmoye oti lipandi elibi mulio linu penia pampakulola tela kuboya kipalamandi chikibi mulio lya nnuna gwinu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Mikipeje imbwa ilebe yachwapi, kupala yakagalambukaje nu kunkwalambula mmene mangweto, na makagalekeleje magolobe lulu inu kupala gakalebataje.</para>
  <para style="s">Nnyope, mpalepale, nng'ombe oti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Nnyope, mangweto mampata, mpalepale na mangweto mamibona, nng'ombange oti mangweto mabannyogola.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mundu jwajoa jwajopa kupata, ojwapalapala kiibona, na ojwagomba oti kunnyogolela. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bo, abi mundu kati jinu anda mwana gwakwe annyopite nkate kumpa libwe? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Andaje ajopite chamaki kumpa lijoka? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Anda yene mangweto mammilingite makabaja mmanyi kipe ingota inu ilebe yambone. Mmanya Awawabinu bu kumbengu bapakape gambone muno abajopa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Matendelange bandu bange andi gamagapala bantendele mangweto. Yene ngapagabi Malagilo ga Musa na maboulo ga akalondoli ba Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Nniango nchokochoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Nnyingilange pa nniango ogubi nchokochoko, magambu ndela ejijenda kukujomoka ngolongwa na nniango gwa kujingi mwenio nkolongwa, abajenda ndela jenie ajingi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu ndela ejijenda kubwomi njokochoko na nniango gu kujingi mweno nchokochoko na bandu achoko tu abijibona ndela jenie.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo umanyikana ngokwa yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Ntamanga maha na akalondoli bu uwangi angweto bakaika kwinu kunja bakabonekana andi mambelele, nambu nkati jabe mamei makale. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mamanya ku itendwa yabe. Bo bandu kutongola zabibu munkongo gwa miba, andaje mbendembe mumpengo? Ije! <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nkongo gwambone kupambika ngokwa yambone, na nkongo mmaja kupambika ngokwa mbaja. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nkongo gwambone kupambikaje ngokwa mbaja, na nkongo mmaja kupambikaje ngokwa inachwapi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kila nkongo gwanga pambika ngokwa inachwapi kueketigwa nu kuuleke pamwoto. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwa yene, mamanyanga akalondoli buwangi ku itendwa yabe.</para>
  <para style="s">Nummanyangitije mangweto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ngiti kila mundu ojwapa kungema ‘Angwana, Angwana,’ Ajingila mukingwana cha kumbengu, nambu jwajo tu ojwapakutenda agabapala Awawa ababi kumbengu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi binnengela lichoba lyene lya hukumu, ‘Angwana, Angwana! Kwa liina linu ngututangacha nhwalo gwinu na kwa liina linu ngutuboya michepela nu kulaya ikobo ijingi!’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Penia manalengela, ‘Numanyije mangweto, mmokange nnongi jango, mangwetomwe makabaja!’</para>
  <para style="s">Akachengi abena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Yene kila mundu ojwajoa malobe gango na kugakamula, malandana na mundu juna malango, ojwachengite nyumba jakwe panani piliganga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ula ngijikoma, ngemba ngitwele mache, kimbonga ngikiika na kujiputa nyumba. Nambu nyumba jigwije kwa magambu jikachengigwa panani pa liganga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Nambu mundu jwajwoa jwajoa malobe gango nu kugakamuje, malandana na mundu jwapunganikwe ojwachengite nyumba jakwe panani pimiyangi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ula ngijikoma ngemba ngitwele mache kimbonga ngikiika ngijiputa nyumba jenie ngijigwe. Kabe luwindu lwakwe lukiba lukolongwa muno!”</para>
  <para style="s">Madalaka ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Yesu pajomola kulenga malobe genia, nkengeni gwa bandu nguomongwa kwa maboulo gakwe. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Abola andi akaboli babeje ba Malagilo ga Musa, nambu jwombe abola kukinala.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu juna maloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pauluka kuboka pikitombi, kikuta cha bandu ajingi ngikinkengama. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngaika mundu jumwe juna maloi, ngakilikitila nukulenga, “Ananhota andampaile nhwotwi kunyeguya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngatondobeya luboko lwakwe kunkunyula mundu jwenio nu kulenga, “Mbala nnyeguke.” Kingobutu mundu jwenio ngajeguka maloi gakwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngannenge, “Mpenakia, makannengeje mundu jwajwoa, nambu nnyende mikikilaye kakung'i na makapange hupo jaamulicha Musa kachalakicha kutenda nnamite.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mpakachi jwana Afisa ba chilikali ja Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu paika pikilambo chuku Kafalanaumu pannyini, kilongoi jumwe jwa Loma nganyendelela, ngampembela annyangate, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ngalenga, “Ananhota mpakachi jwango abi ukaja ntamwe lola na atekupola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela “Mainka kunnamiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kilongoi jwenio ngannenge Yesu, “Ananhota, mbaligweje mwe nnyingi unyumba jango. Nambu nnenge lilobe limwe tu mpakachi jwango malama. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gambu nane uyo namundu nambi pae jikinala cha akinanhota bango, ngweti manjolinjoli ababi pae jango. Anda nannengi jumwe, ‘Nnyende!’ Na jwenio kujenda, anda nannengi jumwe, ‘Nhwike!’ Na jwenio kuika, na andanannengi mpakachi jwango, ‘Nkamule kilebe eche!’ Na jwenio kamula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu pajoa genia, ngaomongwa muno, ngabalenge bandu abakiba bakankengema, “Nannenge kweli nanammonaje mundu jwajoa Kuisilaeli pano ojwakweti imani ngolongwa andi ojo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, bandu ajingi mabaika kuboka kumbwani nu kundonde, benia mabatamanga pamwe pampapala na Ulaimu na Isaka na Yakobo kukingwana chu kumbengu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu angweto abapaligwe kube mukingwana cha Nnoongo papakulekeligwa panja, pulubendu, kwenio bapakugutanga nu ukeya mino.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngannenge kilongoloi jwa Loma, “Nnyabule ukaja na ikabe andi punhwamini.” Na mpakachi jwakwe ngalama kingobu uchache.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamia bandu ajingi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ngaika kachakwe Petulo, ngabakolela akimundu akege Petulo bagolilwike pikindanda, atamwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakamu luboko amama benia kitamwe ngachaboka ngabajema na kabegelela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Piika kimuyo, ngabannetela bandu ajingi abakibanga bakachikila nchepela, jwenio kukulenga Lilobe tu, michepela ngijitila na ngabalamianga bandu boa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Atenda genia kupala galenganile malobe agalongela Nnondoli jwa Nnoongo jwakemigwa Isaya kulenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Jwenio mwene atoile uwina gwito,</para>
  <para style="q">apotwile itamwe ito.”</para>
  <para style="s">Abapaligwa kube achandundame ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu paubona nkengeni gwa bandu guntindile ngabaamulicha akinapunji bakwe bajomboke kujenda kwiye ji lilaba. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mmoli jumwe ju Malagilo ga Musa ngannyendele Yesu ngannengela, “Aboli ne mbakunkengama kila kumpakujenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Mabwea gakweti nduka, ni ijuni yu kunani ikweti uhui, nambu Mwana jwa Mundu akwetije paali pu kubeka mutwe gwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Penia jumwe kati ja akinapunji bakwe ngannenge Yesu, “Angwana, nanji uneke nyende oti nakachike awabango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngajanga, “Ungengame milekange mitui ichike mitui mijakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amulicha kimbonga kipole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngaombe muntumbwi na akinapunji bakwe ngabankengama. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kingobu ucho kimbonga kikolongwa ngikipitila mulilaba na mawimbi ngaga tumbu kuwekela ntumbwi. Nambu Yesu akiba agochi lugono. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabajenda kunnyimuya, ngabalenga, “Angwana, mutukombole, tubakujomo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Mangweto mmi na imani njoko mboni mmi na mbwele?” Ngajinuka ngakikalapila kimbonga na mawimbi, ngukube jee.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabaomongwa, ngabalenga, “Ojo mundu nike? Ata upepo na mawimbi gatenda nnyoa!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamianga bandu abena bina michepela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu paika pikilambo chu Kugadala kwiye ja lilaba, na kwenio bandu abena abakiba ni michepela ngabakongana nabo bakabokela kamakabuli. Bandu benia bakiba bina kujogoya muno, kabe abonikije mundu jukujiga kupeta ndela jenie. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Benia ngaba tumbu kuchobela mwe ma Mwana ba Nnoongo kibi nike natwe? Bo, nhwikila kutupoteka tango kuwikaje kingobu chene?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Papipi na penia pakiba na magolobe nduu agachungigwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Michepela ngajannenge Yesu, “Anda mutuboite mutuleke takagajingi magolobe gala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu ngajilenge, “Aja nnyendange” Penia ngijiboka mu bandu bala ngijijingi mumagolobe. Kipenga choa ngikielela pilichela, nukujingi mulilaba magolobe goa ngagawe na mache.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Akachungi ba magolobe ngabatilanga, ngabajenda kunnyini. Kwenio ngabalandulila ilebe yoa eipitile na bandu bi michepela. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kuboka penia bandu boa bapannyini ngababoka ngabannyendele Yesu, pabammonaga ngabampembela aboke pikilambo chabe.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu jwapolite mmele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngaombe muntumbwi ngajomboka lilaba nukuwika kukilambo chatama. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bandu bange ngabannete mundu ojwapolite mmele gwoa bang'onike pikindanda. Yesu apaibona imani yabe, ngannenge mundu jwenio ojwapolite, “Nnimbe mwojo manango mabaja ginu galekikigwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Penia bange akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabatumbu kuwacha, “Mundu ojo antukana Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya mawacho gabe, ngakonya, “Mboni nhwachanga mabaja mumyoju jinu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chako chikibi kindema muno, kulenga, ‘Nagalekakiye mabaja ginu’ andaje kulenga, ‘Nnyeme nnyende?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ngoe mbala mmanyange kutenda Mwana jwa mundu, akweti kinala chu kulekekeya mabaja ga bandu padunia.” Penia ngannenge jwenio jwapolite, “Nnyinuke, ntole kindanda chinu, nnyabule kachinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mundu jwenio jwapolite ngajinuka ngajabula kachakwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bandu boa ba pankengeni pabagabona genia agatendigwe ngabaomongwa nu kunnumba Nnoongo ojwabapi bandu kinala chenia.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankema Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka penia, na pakiba akajabulaga, ngammona mundu jumwe ojwakemigwa Matayo, atamite panyumba ju kutocha kodi. Ngannengela, “Ungengame.”</para>
  <para style="p">Na jwenio Matayo ngajinuka ngankengama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu pakiba kachakwe Matayo akalya chakulya, akatocha kodi ajingi na akabaja ngabaikanga kutama pamwe nakwe na akinapunji bakwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mafalisayo pabagabona genia, ngagalenge akinapunji ba Yesu, “Mboni aboli binu balye pamwe na akatocha kodi na akabaja?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajoa, ngalenga, “Bandu banga itamwe kunkokaje nng'anga, nambu akatamwe nga abankoka nng'anga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu nnyende mikikibolange mana ga malobe ga Nnoongo agalenga, ‘Mbala, kia ngiti lilumboje.’ Gambu inkila kakema bandu ababikibona bamboneje nambu bandu bina mabaja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukonya nhwalo gwa kupunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji bakwe Yohana Mmatichi ngabannyendelela Yesu, ngabankonya, “Mbone twenga na Mafalisayo tubikupunga pajingi, nambu akinapunji binu babi kupungaje?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bo abakokigwe kumpapala gwa kutola akege bapaligwa ukokaleka na kingobu akoano babi pamwe nabo? Kubeje! Nambu kingobu makiika penia akoano mababoigwa panakati jabe kingobu chenie nga cha kupunga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Bandu kubekaje kibamba cha ngobo nhyono mungobo ng'ona. Gambu kibamba chenie kibakujonjekeya kupapula ngobo ng'ona jenie. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Uyo bandu kubekaje divai nhyono mukitumba kigona. Anda batei yene umanya kitumba kipakupachuka na divai jipakujitika, bandu babekanga divai nhyono mukitumba kiyono, na yoa kitumba na divai maiba tegatega.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kamwale jwa Kilongoi na munkege ntamwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu pakiba akalenga genia kilongoi jumwe jwa Akayahudi ngaika ngannitila nukulenga, “Kamwale jwango ajomwike kingobu uchenje nambu mwe chonde tujende makammeke luboko lwinu malama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ngajinuka ngajabula pamwe na kilongoi jwenio na akinapunji bakwe ngabakengama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nu munkege jumwe, ntamwe ncholo kwa yaka komi nibena, ngankengama Yesu unyuma, ngakunyula lilombola li lutando lwakwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Akawacha kumwojo jakwe kutenda, “Anda ngunywile tu lutando lwakwe manama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ngatendabuka ngammona munkege ngannenge, “Manango nnimbe mwojo imani jinu jinnamiye.” Munkege jwenio ngalama kingobu ucho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngaika kachakwe kilongoi jwenio. Na pababona bandu bakajemba pilimbi na bandu kuguta, <verse number="24" style="v"/>ngabalenge, “Mpitange panja! Kamwale ojo awije, atekugoche tu.” Nambu benia ngaba nhweka. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nkengeni gwa bandu pupita panja, Yesu ngajingi unyumba, ngankamula luboko kamwale jola na jwenio ngajema. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nhwalo gwenio gujoanika kilambo choa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamianga bangalola abena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka penia, na apakiba undela, bangalola akabena ngabankengama nu kuchobela, “Mwana jwa Daudi, mutubone kia!” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu pajingila unyumba, bangalola akabena ngabannyendelela, Yesu ngabakonya, “Bo, nhwamininge kube nenga nhotwile kunnamiya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Angweto ngabajanga, “Elo Angwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngankunyula mio gabe, ngalenga, “Pibi imani inu itende uyo!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mio gabe ngagaoto kulola. Yesu ngabakelebuya kukalipa, “Makannengeje mundu jwajwoa kilebe chenje!” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngababokanga, nu kutangacha kilebe chenie chatei Yesu kilambo choa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia bubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bandu abakiba bakajendanga kachabe bange ngabannete mundu jumwe jwakiba bubu magambu akiba na nchepela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kingobutu puboigwa nchepela mundu jwenio ngalonge kabele. Bandu ngabaomwongwa nu kulenga, “Kilebe eche chanabonekanaje pakilambo chenje cha Isilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nambu Mafalisayo ngagalenga, “Aboya michepela kwa makakala ga nkolongwa ju michepela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu babone kia bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngatyanga mwilambo yoa na ijiji. Ngababola mumajumba gabe gu kugongalela nukutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone gwa kingwana cha Nnoongo na kulamiya itamwe yoa na kubinia kwoa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu apababona nkengeni gwa bandu, ngababone kia kwa magambu bakibanga lola na mbwele andi mambelele ganga nchungi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Penia ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe, “Mauno majingi nambu akakamwa maengo achoko. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Majopange angwana ba mauno bakinge akakamu maengo baunange mauno gakwe.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Achandundame komi na abena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakema akinapunji bakwe komi na abena, ngabapeganga inala yu kuboya michepela na kulamia itamwe nu kubinia kwoa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ganga nga maina ga achandundame komi na abena, jukutumbula, Simoni ojwakemigwa Petulo na nnunagwakwe Andulea, Yakobo na nnunagwakwe Yohana yene ingota ya Zebedayo, na Yohana, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Filipo na Batolomayo, Tomasi na Matayo ojwakiba ntocha kodi, Yakobo mwana jwa Alufayo, na Tadei, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Simoni nkola Nkananayo, na Yuda Isikalioti ojwang'aluka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu batumanga achandundame komi na abena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:16">Luka 9:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakinga benia komi na abena na kape malagilo ganga, “Makajendaje kubandu bangammanya Nnoongo, andaje muilambo ya Akasamalia. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu nnyendange kunyumba ya bandu bu Kuisilaeli abaobite andi mambelele. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pannyendanga kutangacha nhwalo gwa Nnoongo nnenga, ‘Kingwana chu kumbengu kibandakile!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nnamiange akatamwe, mayoyange abawile, majeguyange bina maloi, mmoyange michepela. Mpatangita bule, na mangweto mpanganga bule. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Makapotoje jaabu andaje uloi, andaje madini agakemigwa feza andaje liaba mumiuku jinu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mumwanja gwinu makapotoje nkoba gukujope ilebe undela, ni mikogo mibenaje, ni ilatu yengeje, bokola jengeje. Mana nkamwa maengo apaligwa kupoke chapala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Anda nhwike pikilambo mumpalanga mundu jwajwoa ojwabi lachi kumpokela na ntamanga na jwenio mpaka pampakuboka kilambo chenie. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apanhwika panyumba malengela, ‘Tengela jibe kwinu.’ <verse number="13" style="v"/>Anda akakola nyumba bajeketile abali jinu, umanya tengela jinu jitama pamwe na angweto. Nambu anda bampokije bai tengela jinu jimmujila mmene makangweto. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Anda mundu jwajoa akanite kumpokela andaje kumpenikia bai pampakuboka panyumba jenie andaje kilambo chenie mpyatanga litukunda mumakongono ginu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli lichoba lya hukumu bandu bikilambo chenie bapakupata hukumu ngolongwa kupeta hukumu jijapatite bandu bu Kusodoma na Gomola.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga okupakuika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maluko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:12-17">Luka 2:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Lele, ne nankinga mangweto andi mambelele panakati ja mamei. Mmaganga makakalamui andi lijoka, na mmaganga mangakijonga andi ngunda. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ntamanga maha na bandu, gambu bapakumpeleka kamabalacha nu kumputanga bokola mumajumba gabe gu kugongalela. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mabampelekanga kwa akatawala na akangwana kwa magambu gangune, kupala kuchalakicha kwabe nu kubandu bangammanya Nnoongo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pabapakumpeleka kamabalacha makapweleje kilebe champakulongela kingobu anda kiike mampatanga chukulongela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gambu mpakulonge mangwetumweje nambu apakulonge Uhuke jwa Nnoongo ojwabi nkati jinu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mundu anng'aluka nnunagwakwe akomigwe, na awawa banng'aluka mwana gwabe, ni ingota mayajingalila achikibelei mundu na kakomanga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bandu boa bapakunchimwa mangweto kwa magambu ga liina lyango. Nambu ojwapakuimbalila mpaka kupela, nga ojwapakomboka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bandu anda bampoteka pikilambo chimwe ntilila kilambo chenge. Nannenge kweli nyomoje mwanja gwinu muilambo yoa ya Kuisilaeli nukuikaje Mwana jwa Mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Napunji kapetaje aboli bakwe, na mmanda nkolongwaje kapeta angwana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Napunji apala abe andi aboli mundu na mmanda apala abe andi angwana mundu. Anda munanhota pakaja bankema Belizebuli mmanya akalongamundu bapakemigwa maina mabaja muno.</para>
  <para style="s">Mene jukujogopigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:4-7">Luka 12:4-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Makajobokaje bandu benia. Kila chikiekeligwe kiba kuekuligwa, na kila chikiigwe kiba kubonekana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Chinannenge pulubendu, mikilenga pandaa, na kilebe chimikijoa chakang'ing'iigwa ntandachanga pukongolou. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Makajogopaje abakoma mmele, nambu kuotwaje koma na kiuke. Mbaya kunyogopa Nnoongo jwaotwile kukoma mmele na kiuke nukunneke kumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iyebele ibena iuchigwa yumuni nhwano. Nambu kibije ata kiyebele chimwe chekigwe paye pangapala Awabinu bu kumbengu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu kwinu mangweto nywili yu mutwe gwinu ibalangigwe yoa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwa yene makajogopaje, mangweto mwe mambone muno kupeta iyebele ijingi!</para>
  <para style="s">Kujeketela na kunkana Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Kila mundu ojwanyeketela pabandu, nane uyo manannyeketela nnongi ja Awabango ababi kumbengu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nambu jwajwoa ojwapakungana pabandu, nane manakana nnongi ja Awabango ababi kumbengu.</para>
  <para style="s">Nhikila kuleta tengelaje nambu upanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Makakita nhikila kubeka tengelaje padunia. Nambu nhikila kubeka tengelaje nambu upanga. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Gambu nhikila kubeka kupwilikana panakati ja mundu na awamundu, panakati ja nhwenja na amamundu, panakati ja nkoano na akimundu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na angondwa ba mundu biba akalongomundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Abapala awamundu andaje amamundu kumbeta nenga, benia babi kumbalaje nenga. Abapampala mwana munalome mwana munkege kumbeta nenga, kupaligwaje kube napunji. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mundu jwangapotola nchalaba gwakwe nu kungengama, kupaligwaje kube napunji jwango. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mundu jwajoa ojwaagabala bwomi gwakwe, apakuoya na ojwaoya bwomi gwakwe kwa magambu gangu nenga, apakupata.</para>
  <para style="s">Hupo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maluko 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Abampoke mangweto bamboke nenga, na abamboke nenga bapoke abandumite. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mundu jwajoa ojwampoke nnondoli kwa magambu ga nnondoli, mapokela hupo yu ulondoli. Ojwampoke mundu jwa mwojo gwambone kwa magambu ga mwojo gwambone apokela upo ya mwojo gwambone. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli, jwajoa ojwapakumpe mundu jumwe kati ja akachoko aba kata ja mache gukunywe gambu jwenio napunji jwango, apelelwaje kupoke hupo yakwe.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mmatichi bakinga akapakachi bakwe kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pajomola kapeganga akinapunji bakwe malagilo ngaboka penia, ngajenda kubola na katangachila bandu mwilambo yuku Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yohana Mmatichi pakiba mukipungo ngajoa ilebe yatenda Yesu Kilisto. Yohana ngabatuma akinapunji bakwe bankonye Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kulenga, “Bo, mwe nga jwajo ojwaika andaje tunnende jonge?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Nnyendange makannenge Yohana ilebe imijoa ni kibona, <verse number="5" style="v"/>bangalola kulola, nangwaba kujenda, bina maloi batenda kujeguigwa na bangajoa kujoa, abawile kuyoka na akahocho katangachilanga Nhwalo Gwambone. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mbaya mundu jwajo jwangabe na mbwele nane!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Akinapunji ba Yohana pabajabulanga, Yesu ngatumbu kalengelanga bandu minhalo ja Yohana, “Majendanga kulolanga nike kupongoti kola? Bo, mapala kilibona linyai elipoge mboga? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lele nnyela kulola nike? Nnyela kunnola mundu ojwakwindite ngobo inakualala? Bandu abakwindite ngobo inakualala batamanga mumajumba gi kingwana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Unengelange nnyela kummona meneke? Nnondoli? Eluwe, kweli Yohana akiba kupeta nnondoli. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Jwenio nga ojwalengigwa Mumajandiko ga Chwapi. ‘Nnoongo alenga, mbakunkinga mmanda jwango, annongolele nu kumpanganakia ndela jinu.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, panakati ja ingota yoa eibelwike nu munkege anapitije ojwabi nkolongwa kumpeta Yohana Mmatichi. Nu uyo na jwajo ojwabi nchokochoko muno mukingwana chu kumbengu jwenio nga nkolongwa kumpeta Yohana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuboka kingobu cha Yohana mpaka ngoe, kingwana cha kumbengu kitoligwa na bandu bina makakala, na bandu bina makakala bapalanga kukitola kwa makakala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuboka pukutumbula mpaka kingobu cha Yohana, akalondoli boa na Malagilo ga Musa galondola ilebe i kingwana chu kumbengu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Anda nhwotolinge kujeketela kube Yohana nga Eliya ojwalengigwa apakuika. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Juna machikilo ajoe!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Bandu bangoe balandine na nike? Andi achakakombo abatamangite pachoko, bakalengelana kuboka kikuta chimwe kukilenge chenge, <verse number="17" style="v"/>‘Tunhwonalinge ng'oma nambu mangweto nhwinangitije! Tunnyembilinge minhambo jukokaleka mangweto nng'utangitije!’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yohana ngaika, akiba kupunga na anywije divai, angweto ngabalenga, ‘Akweti nchepela.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwana jwa Mundu ngaika, kulye nu kunywe, angweto ngabalenga, ‘Mummone mundu ojo, kupojoka nu kulobela, nng'anja gwa akatocha kodi na bina mabaja!’ Nambu uwecho gwa Nnoongo ubonekana gwambone kuboka muitendwa yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ilambo yangaamini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kubokapenia Yesu ngatumbu kakalapila bandu bi ilambo yatenda ikobo ijingi nambu bandu ba kwenio balapangitije mabaja gabe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Kulaga mwe! Kilambo chu Kukolasini, kulaga kilambo chu Kubetisaida! Gambu ikobo yanatenda kachinu ilaigwe kukilambo chu Kutilo na Kusidoni bandu bakwe kabi bakwindangite ngobo ya magunia nu kupakala maliu kulaya balapite. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, ipakube kindema kwa bandu ba Tilo na Sidoni kuimbalila hukumu jabe lichoba lya hukumu, kupeta mangweto. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Na mwenga, ma Kafalanaumu, bo, mikitondabeya mpaka kumbengu? Manhwuluigwa mpaka kumambi! Gambu, ikobo yanatei kwinu yakatendigwe Kusodoma, kilambo chenie chakaba tango mpaka lele. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nambu nannenge, lichoba lya hukumu mwenga mpakupata hukumu ngolongwa kupeta ja Kusodoma!”</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwike kwango mpomolele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kingobu chenia Yesu ngalenga, “Nannumba mwe Mawawa, Mangwana bu kumbengu na padunia, magambu ilebe yene maiite bandu bunuwecho na bina malango, ngamaekulila akinangota. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Elo, Awawa yene nga pampaile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Awabango bangamwiye ilebe yoa. Abije ojwammanyi Mwana nambu Awawa, na abije ojwabamanyi Awawa nambu Mwana, na jwajo ojwapai Mwana kunhwekulila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nhwike kwango mmowa mannaganga nu kutopiigwa ni miigo nenga manampomolea. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mikitabange kingolingoli chango, mikibole kwango, gambu nenga nanuu nu kunyenyepa umwojo na mangweto mma na laa mumyojo jinu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Gambu kingolingoli chango kakataje nu nhwigo gwango nnyojou.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:30">Ng'ombe ibena ilema kongo bikwindi ingolingoli</figure></para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Angwana ba Lichoba Lya Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie, Yesu akiba akapeta mumigonda ja ngano Lichoba li Kupomolela. Akinapunji bakwe ngabalola njala, ngabatumbu kuchwamula miejo ja ngano, ngabamemena. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafalisayo pababonanga genia, ngabankonya Yesu, “Nnola, akinapunji binu batendanga kilebe changapaligwa mumalagilo gito Lichoba li Kupomolela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bo, nchomangitije patenda Daudi pamwe nakajakwe kingobu apabakiba na njala? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jwenio ngajingi unyumba ja Nnoongo ngalye mikate ejibekigwe nnongi ja Nnoongo. Jwenio na akajabe bapaligwije kulye mikate jenie nambu akakung'i tu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bo, nchomangitije kitabu cha Malagilo ga Musa agalenga kila Lichoba li Kupomolela akakung'i baalabia Malagilo gi Lichoba li Kupomolela unyumba ja Nnoongo, nambu babi kabalangije kutenda babi malemwa? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bai, nannengelanga yene pambano abi nkolongwa kupeta nyumba ja Nnoongo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Makagamanyi gangano, ‘Mbala kia ngiti lilumboje.’ Kabi mahukumwije bandu banga malemwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gambu Mwana jwa Mundu akweti uwecho ata Lichoba li Kupomolela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwa polite luboko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka penia ngajenda kunyumba jabe ji kugongalela. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mweno akiba mundu jumwe ojwapolite luboko. Bandu ngabankonya Yesu, “Bo, ipaligwe kunnamia mundu Lichoba li Kupomolela?” Bakonya genia kupala kuntega alemwe bantakiane.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabalengela, “Tulenge kati jinu anda abi mundu jwakweti limbelele lyakwe elitumbakile mulichela, bo, ampukije nukumpia Lichoba li Kupomalela? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu mundu nga jwambone kupeta limbelele! Ipaligwe kutenda gambone Lichoba li Kupomolela.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngannenge mundujo, “Ntondobeye luboko lwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngatondobeya, luboko ngululama ngulube andi longe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mafalisayo ngagapita panja ngababeka machabuli gu kunkoma Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndundame ojwa pambuligwe na Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu pamanya nhwalo gwenio ngaboka paali penia. Bandu ajingi ngabankengama, ngabalamiyanga akatamwe boa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngabaamulicha kutenda bakalenge banduje minhalo jakwe, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kupala galenga nnondoli Isaya galenganile,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nnole mpakachi jwango junumpambwile,</para>
  <para style="q">jwambala anhalalile kumwojo.</para>
  <para style="q">Mbakubeka kihuke chango panani jakwe,</para>
  <para style="q">jwenio atangacha hukumu jango kwa bandu bangammanya Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Abeje nimitau wala manjega,</para>
  <para style="q">wala lilobe lyakwe lijoanikaje undela.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nnai ogubugujwike ntwekuje na lumuli oluchikichila aimiyaje,</para>
  <para style="q">mpaka papakubeka hukumu ja chwapi jitawale.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa jwenio bandu bangammanya Nnoongo babakube nilihyobalelo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Mmaja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maluko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Penia bandu ngabannete Yesu mundu jumwe jwangalola na akiba bubu magambu akiba na nchepela. Yesu ngannamiya mpaka ngaotola kulola nu kulongela. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nkengeni gwoa gwa bandu nguomongwa ngabalenga, “Pangaje ojo nga Mwana jwa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nambu Mafalisayo pabajoa genia, “Ngabalenga mundu ojo abenga michepela ku uwecho gwa Belizebuli nkolongwa ju michepela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu, amanyi mawacho gabe ngabalengela, “Kingwana chachoa anda kibaganike ikuta ikuta itumbakane, kujendeke yaka nduje, ni kilambo chachoa andaje lungolo lwalwoa lukibagine ikuta ikuta eijomana lupakugwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Anda lichetani lijomana ni Lichetani lijakwe likitumbakania lyene kingwana chakwe kilamabo? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mangweto nnengabo kutenda nijibenga michepela kwa makakala ga Belizebuli, abankengama mangweto babenga michepela kuwecho gwabeneke? Kwa magambu genia angweto nga abapakunhwukumula. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu anda nijibenga michepela kwa makakala ga Uhuke jwa Nnoongo, mmanyanga kingwana cha Nnoongo kiike kwinu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Abije mundu ojwapakuoto kujingi munyumba ja mundu juna makakala nu kumpoka ilebe yoa, mpaka antabe oti mundu jwenio? Penia apakuoto kumpoka ilebe yoa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mundu jwajwoa jwanganonda nenga, angana nenga, na jwajoa jwangakongola pamwe na nenga, atenda kuambugana. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwa magambu genia nannenge bandu mabalekekeigwa mabaja na matukano gabe goa, nambu balekekeaje kwa mabaja gu kuntukana Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kabe, ojwalenga lilobe li kunkana Mwana jwa Mundu malekekiigwa, nambu ojwalenga lilobe li kunkana Uhuke jwa Chwapi, alekekeiigwaje, napaduniaje, na wala Kumbenguje.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo na kupambikakwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:43-45">Maluko 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Nkongo gwambone kupambika kwakwe makuba kwambone na nkongo mmaja kupambika kwakwe kuba kubaja. Nkongo umanyikana kukupambika ngokwa yakwe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mangwetomwe machamajoka nhwotwabo kulenga kilebe chambone na kongo mmene makabaja? Gambu mundu alonge agaboka umwojo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mundu jwambone apiya agabi gambone kuboka mumwojo gwakwe, na mundu mmaja apiya mabaja kuboka mumwojo gwakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Nannengalanga, lichoba lya hukumu kila mundu apaligwa kujanga kila lilobe lyalongela lyangapaligwa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Gambu kwa malobe ginu mannyeketeligwa kube mambone, na kwa malobe ginu manhukumigwa kube mabaja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kupala kuibona ikobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maluko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kuboka penia akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo ngabannenge Yesu, “Aboli, tupala kuibona iingi yi ikobo kuboka kwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Jwombe ngabajanga bandu bangoe akabaja banga mmanya Nnoongo!” Bapala iingi yi ikobo bapatangaje, nambu bapata kikobo cha nnondoli Yona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kitama chatama Yona mulutumbo lwa chamaki machoba matatu kilo na mui, ngipipakube ku Mwana jwa Mundu papakutama nkati mulutope. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bandu bi kilambo chu Kuninawi mabapitila kingobu cha hukumu, na angweto buluhukumula lungolo londo kube na malemwa. Gambu bandu ba Kuninawi balapanga kwa matangacho ga Yona, na pamba abi Nkolongwa kupeta Yona! <verse number="42" style="v"/>Linyongolo lya kubanda mapitila mangobu bandu bamba pabapa kuhukumigwa, magambu jwenio ngaboka kachakwe kutaali ngaika kupenikia gambone ga Solomoni napamba abi nkolongwa kumpeta Solomoni.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubuja kwa nchepela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Nchepela anda ubengigwe kwa mundu, utindila tindila papongoti pajomo kupala paali apomolele anda kupataje. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Penia alongela jika, ‘Mambuja kachango kumokitage.’ Nambu pupakubuja nikijikole jibi janga kilebe jipyagiligwe nu ilekaileka, <verse number="45" style="v"/>aijenda kujitola jengi michepela saba, jinamakakala kupeta jwenio, na jwenio kuika kunnyingilila mundujo na ali ja mundu jwenio jibakube mbaja kupeta pitumbula. Ngipipakube ku bandu akabaja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Akalongo ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu akiba tango akalongela nankengeni gwa bandu kingobu amamundu ni inuna yakwe pabaika nu kujema panja. Bapala kulonge nakwe. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Bai mundu jumwe ngannenge, “Amabinu na inuna inu babi panja, bapala kulonge na mwe.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngannyanga mundu jwenio, “Amabango ngabeneke? Ni inuna yango nga beneke?” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Penia ngatondobea luboko lwakwe kalangila akinapunji bakwe, ngalenga, “Angwetwa nga Amabango ni inuna yango! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Jwajwoa ojwakamwa agabapala Awabango ababi kumbengu, jwenio nga nnuna gwango na nnombwango Amabango.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa Mpandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lichoba ulyo, Yesu ngaboka panyumba jenie, ngajenda kutama umbwega ji lilaba. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ikuta ya bandu ngintindila mpaka Yesu ngaombe muntumbwi ngatama. Bandu boa bakajema umbwega ji lilaba, <verse number="3" style="v"/>penia Yesu ngabalenge malobe majingi kukulandanikia.</para>
  <para style="p">“Mpenikiange! Mpandi ngajenda kumicha mbeju. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakiba akamicha mbeju, yenge ngitola pandela, ijuni ngiika ngionyola. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yenge ngitola pamaganga pangabe nu lutope lujingi. Ngimalika chokwe magambu lutope lukiba lujingije. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lumu pulubala ngijoma, na magambu mikega jakwe jikiba janga makakala, ngilembuka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yenge ngitola pimikongo jamiba, na miba ngikola nu kuibalakia. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yenge ngitola pulutope lwa mbone, ngimalika na ngipambika muno, yenge mbonje mia jimwe, yenge sitini na yenge salasini. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na juna machikilo ajoe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mana ju kulonge kukulandanakia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe ngabannyendelela, ngabankonya, “Mbona mwe nnonge na bandu kukulandanakia?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mangwetomwe nkweti upeele gu kumanya chili ji kingwana chu kumbengu, nambu angwetwa bakwetije.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Magambu mundu juna kilebe majonjekeigwa, nambu jwanga kola kilebe, na chache kichoko cha kweti kipakutoligwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nganonge nabo ku kulandanakia, kwa magambu babi kulola nambu kuibonaje, babi kupenekia nambu kujoaje nu kumanyaje. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwabe galenganile agalenga nnondoli Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“ ‘Kupenakia mabapenakia, nambu bamanyangaje.</para>
  <para style="q">Kulola mannola, nambu mibonaje.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Magambu malango ga bandu bamba gapunganikwe,</para>
  <para style="q">baibangite machikilo gabe,</para>
  <para style="q">mio bachwilile gabe.</para>
  <para style="q">Makaloile kwa mio ginu,</para>
  <para style="q">andaje maka joine kwa machikilo ginu,</para>
  <para style="q">makamanyi kwa malango ginu,</para>
  <para style="q">nu kundendebukia, balenga Angwana,</para>
  <para style="q">nane kabinalamiinge.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga kabele, “Nambu mbaya mangweto, gambu mio ginu gabikulola na machikilo ginu gabikujoa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, akalondoli ba Nnoongo na bandu bambone ajingi bapaile kugabona gamagabona, bakagabonaje, nu kugajoa gamagajoa, bakagajoaje.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balenge nhwalo gwa kulandanakia kwa mpandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mangweto mpenakiange na mikibole kulandanakia kwa mpandi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mundu ojwajoa nhwalo gu Kingwana cha Nnoongo nu kuumanyaje, ngatela na mbeju eitoi pandela, Mmaja kuika nu kuboya chikipandigwe mumwojo gwa mundu jwenio. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mbeju ipandigwe pamaganga andi mundu ojwajoa lilobe lya Nnoongo kulipokela chokwe nu kuala mwojo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nambu kolaje ngega nkati jakwe, aijendekea kuliagabala lilobe lyene kingobu tu, kingobu chu kulaga ni michwembo apajipitila magambu ga lilobe lyene, kuotwaje kujendekea. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mbeju eitoi panakati ja miba andi mundu ojwajoa lilobe lyene, nambu kwa mbwele ja dunia na uloi kupala kulilimbalakia lilobe lyenie na jwenio kujendekeaje kulikengama. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mbeju eipandigwe pulutope lwa mbone andi mundu ojwajoa lilobe lyenie na kulimanya, nu kupambika ngokwa, bange mya na bange sitini na bange salasini.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na manyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge bandu kulandanakia konge, “Kingwana chu kumbengu kilandine yene. Mundu ojwapandite mbeju yambone munng'onda gwakwe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nambu bandu pabakiba lugono, nngondwa jwakwe ngaika nukupanda manyai panakati ja ngano, nukujabula. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mbeju pimalika nu kutumbu kubeula manyai ngagatumbu kubonekana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Akapakachi ba nkola nng'onda ngabannyendelela, nu kunnenge, ‘Angwana, mbemelela makapanda mbeju ya mbone munng'onda gwinu. Lele manyai gaboka koo?’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Jwenio ngabajanga, ‘Nngondwa nga ojwatei yenie’. Akapakachi bakwe ngabankonya, ‘Bo, mpaile tujende takagajikule?’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Jwombe ngabajanga, ‘Ije, makatenda yeneje mannyikula manyai pamwe na ngano. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Magaleke gakole pamwe mpaka pagapakuika mauno. Kingobu chenie nailengala akauni, nkongolange oti manyai ntabe makendeka nu kupamba mwoto. Nambu ngano nkongolange makabeke mikikokwe chango.’”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa mbeju ya aladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela bandu kulandanakia konge, “Kingwana cha kumbengu kilandine yene. Mundu ngapanda mbeju njokonjoko, munng'onda gwakwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yenie ibi mbonji njokonjoko kupeta mbeju yoa, nambu anda imalike iba ngolongwa kupeta ipandwa yoa. Ukola nukube nkongo nkolongwa ni ijuni yu kunani kuika kuchenga mihui mundambi yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na kimela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela kulandanakia konge, “Kingwana cha kumbengu kilandine yene. Amama bamwe abatoi amila ngabatindagana na madebe mabele na nusu ga unga, penia unga gwoa ngutupa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela kukulandanakia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maluko 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge bandu genia goa kukulandanakia. Alongije chachoa panga landanakia. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ibe ilenganile na lilobe lyalenga Nnondoli jwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="q">“Nongela nabo kukulandanakia,</para>
  <para style="q">mbakupiya gangamanyikana kuboka pijipanganigwe dunia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alandulila kulandanakia kwa manyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngatabuka bandu bala, ngajingi unyumba. Akinapunji bakwe ngabannyendelela ngabannengela, “Mutulandulile kulandanakia kwa manyai munng'onda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mpandi jwa mbeju ya mbone nga Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nng'onda gola nga dunia. Mbeju ya mbone nga bandu ababi ba Kingwana cha Nnoongo nga chabe. Nambu manyai nga bandu bi Mmaja. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nngondwa ojwapandita manyai gala nga Mmaja. Mauno nga kupela kwa ile yoa na akauni nga akapakachi ba Nnoongo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Andi yene manyai apagakonjaligwa nu kugapamba mwoto, ngapaipa kube lichoba lya kiama. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwana jwa Mundu mabakinga Akapakachi bakwe kuboka kumbengu bakongalange bandu kuboka mukingwana chakwe boa abajambukia ilebe ibaja, na boa abakamu mabaja, <verse number="42" style="v"/>na kalekela pilibomba lya mwoto kwenio bapakuguta nu kuyaga mino. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Penia bandu bambone bala bapakung'ala andi lichoba mukingwana cha Awawa mundu. Juna machikilo ajoe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa ilebe eiigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Kingwana chu kumbengu kilandine yene. Mundu jumwe ngaibona jaabu, ngaiya kabele. Ngaala mwojo muno, ngajenda kuucha ilebe yakwe yoa eyakiba nayo, ngajenda kuemela nng'onda gwenio.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Kabe Kingwana chu kumbengu kilandine yene mundu ojwapalapala lulu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Papata lulu jimwe ja mbone muno, ngajenda kuucha ilebe yoa eyakweti, ngaemela lulu jene.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na lipelele lya yamaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Kabe, Kingwana cha kumbengu kilandine yene. Akakoki bange balekile lipelele mulilaba, ngilijonja yamaki ya aina ndu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Pilitwelela, ngabaliuta pajomo ngabatama, kuchagula yamaki yambone ngababekanga mulipakacha yabe, yangambone ngabailekela. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Paipakube lichoba lya kiama, akapakachi ba kumbengu bapitilanga babagana akabaja na bambone, <verse number="50" style="v"/>Na kalekela pamwoto bandu akabaja, kwenio bapakuguta nu kuyaga mino.”</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo manhyono na magona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu ngakonya, “Bo, magamanyi genia?” Ngabajeketelanga, “Elo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Jwombe ngabalenge, “Aboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ababe napunji bi Kingwana chu kumbengu balandine na nkola nyumba ojwapiya munkoba gwakwe ilebe igona na iyono.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanigwa kukilambo cha ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu pajomola kulenga kulandanakia kwenio ngaboka paali penia, <verse number="54" style="v"/>ngabuja kachakwe. Kwenio ngabe bakabolanga bandu munyumba jabe ja kugongalela mpaka ngabaomongwa, ngabalenga. “Jwenio apatite ko malango aga? Na apatite ko makakala ga ukamula ikobo? <verse number="55" style="v"/>Bo, ojo mwana jwa pundi chalamala joje? Bo, amamundu Amaliamu na akakaka mundu acha Yakobo na Yusufu na simoni na Yuda? <verse number="56" style="v"/>Bo, akalombo mundu babilingiteje upamba na twenga? Lele, apatite ko genia goa?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Ngababe na mbwele nakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu Yesu ngabalengela, “Nnondoli kupataje ichima kachakwe na kubandu bakwe nambu kubandu bange, kupata ichima.” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Nayene penia alaiteje ikobo ijingi kwa magambu gwangaamini gwabe.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiu cha Yohana Mmatichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie, Helode ojwakiba Nngwana jwa kilambo cha Galilaya, ngajoa yoa yakamula Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngabalenge akapakachi bakwe, “Mundu ojojo nga Yohana Mmatichi, atekuyoka kuboka kwa abawile, nga magambu makakala gi ikobo ikamu maengo nkati jakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Helode nga ojwaamulicha kuntaba Yohana mikipungo, ngantaba mitondolo na kummeka mikipungo kwa magambu ga Helodia, jwenio akiba nhwana gwa nnuna gwakwe Filipo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gakiba mangobu Yohana akannenge Helode, “Ipaligweje mwenga kutola munkege ojo kube nhwanagwinu!” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Helode ngapala kunkoma Yohana, nambu ajogopa bandu magambu Yohana akiba Nnondoli jwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lichoba lya mpapala gu kombokela kubelekwa kwa Helode, kamwale jwa Helodia atekuina nnongi ja akageni. Helode ngaala mwojo, <verse number="7" style="v"/>mpaka Helode ngalagana kumpe kamwali jwenio kilebe cha chochoa chapa kujopa mapata. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na kongo amamundu bakankwelekeya, ajope ngajopa, “Umbe upamba mutwe gwa Yohana Mmatichi mulichinia.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nngwana Helode ngaechuka nambu kwa magambu gu kulapila kwakwe na kwa magambu akageni bampapala ngaamulicha apate. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Helode ngantuma mundu, ajende mukipungo akanhwekete mutwe Yohana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mutwe gwakwe nguletigwa mulichinia, ngabampe kamwale jwenio, jwombe ngabapeleke amamundu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Akinapunji ba Yohana ngabaika, ngabatola mmele gwa Yohana ngabachika. Kuboka penia ngabajenda kunnandulila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapeganga ilyo bandu ajingi kupeta bandu elufu itatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu pajoa genia, ngaboka paali penia muntumbwi, ngajenda paali pantemela nambu bandu ngabamanya ngabankengama kuboka muilambo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Apauluka muntumbwi, ngaubona nkengeni nkolongwa gwa bandu, ngababone kia, ngabalamiya akatamwe babe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Piika kimuyo, akinapunji bakwe ngabannyendelela ngabannenge, “Pamba papongoti, na ngoe kutipike, maleke bandu bajabule kiilambo yabe bakaemele yakulya.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bakajabulangaje, mapegange mangweto ilyo.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngabannenge, “Tukweti mikate nhwano tu na yamaki ibele.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Unetelange pamba.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ngabaamulicha bandu batame pae pamanyai. Penia Yesu ngatola mikate nhwano jela na yamaki ibena yela, ngalola kunani kumbengu, ngannumba Nnoongo. Kuboka penia ngametula mikate, ngabape akinapunji bakwe, na akinapunji bakwe ngababaganakia bandu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabalye nu kujukuta. Kuboka penia akinapunji ngabalokota imbolopolo iigile ngabatwele ikapo komi ni ibena. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Abalilangite bakiba akinalome elufu nhwano pangabalanga akikege ni ingota.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda panani pa mache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kingobucho, Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe baombe muntumbwi, balongalele kwiye jililaba kingobu mwene bannekite akatabuka bandu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuboka pakatabuka bandu ngaombe pikitombi jika jakwe kunng'ongalela Nnoongo. Piika kimuyo, jwenio akiba kwenio jika jakwe, <verse number="24" style="v"/>na kingobu ntumbwi gwenio puika panakati ji lilaba, nambu ngube mukomo gambu gu upepo gukaibi ntumbwi gwenio.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kilo kupabandakila kuche Yesu ngabajendelela akinapunji bakwe akajenda panani ja mache. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe pabammona akajenda panani pamache ngabajogopa muno, ngabalenga, “Lihoka” ngabachobela chamila kwa mbwele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kingobu ucho Yesu ngalonge nabo, “Nkotokange, nga nenga. Makajogopaje!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petulo ngannengela Yesu, “Angwana, anda kweli mwenga unenge ne nyende panani ja mache nhike kwenio.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Aja, nhwikage.” Petulo ngauluka muntumbwi, ngajenda panani pa mache, ngannyendele Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu paubona upepo gola, ngajoboka, ngatumbu kumilwa, ngaguta kulilobe likolongwa “Angwana, ungole!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngatondabeya luboko lwakwe, ngankamula nu kunnenge, “Mwe mammi na imani njokochoko! Mbone nnoila mbwele?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngabaombelanga muntumbwi, nu upepo ngukotoka. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Akinapunji boa abakiba nkati ja ntumbwi ngaba nng'ongolela ngabalenga “Kweli mwenga ma Mwana jwa Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamiya akatamwe kukilambo cha Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maluko 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ngabajomboka lilaba, ngabajenda Kugenesaleti. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bandu ba kwenio ngabamanya kutenda jwenio nga Yesu. Ngabalandulila ngijoanika, kilambo choa, ngabannetela akatamwe boa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ngabannyopa bankunyule lubiniko lwa ngobo jakwe, na penia boa abankunywile ngabalama.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Maboulo ga bandu ba lolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maluko 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Penia Mafalisayo na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabaika kuboka kukilambo cha Kuyelusalemu, ngannyendelela Yesu, ngabankonya, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Mboni akinapunji binu kagaagabaje Malagilo gatupokila kuboka kwa akaokobito? Ukuyanga kwa mboneje maboko tango nukulyeje!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mboni mangwetumwe kuagabaje Amuli ja Nnoongo nambu kugapala maboulo ginu mmene? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nnoongo alenga, ‘Kajoa awabinu na amabinu,’ Na ‘Jwajoa ojubatukana awamundu andaje amamundu akomigwe.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambu mangwetumwe mmolananga yene anda mundu anda akweti kilebe chakape awamundu andaje amamundu, nambu anda alengite ‘Kilebe chenje nampi Nnoongo.’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ipaligwije kabele kajoa awamundu andaje amamundu! Penia nga pimililemwa lilobe lya Nnoongo ku ukengama malagilo ginu mmene. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mangweto mamikitenda mambone! Isaya alondola tela pammile!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nnoongo alenga, ‘Bandu aba bannyali kwa malobe tu,</para>
  <para style="q">nambu myojo jabe jibi kutaali nane.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kung'ongale kwabe kwambonije,</para>
  <para style="q">mana ilebe ibabolana nga malagilo ga bandu tu, benia bakitanga gangonenga!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Ilebe eimmeka mundu mumalemwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maluko 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ngaukema nkengeni gwa bandu, ngaulengela, “Umbenekiange na mmanyange! <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kilebe echikimmeka mundu mumalemwa chekijingi mukanoje, nambu chache echikipita mukano chenie nga echammeka mundu mumalemwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji bakwe ngabannyendelela ngabannengela, “Bo, mwe mmanyi kube Mafalisayo bakate kuchimwanga pabagajoa malobe ginu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabajanga, “Kila kipando changa panda Awawa bango bukumbengu, kipakujikuligwa.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Malekange bene akangweto! Angweto banga lola, akilongoi ba bangalola, na jwangalola anda annongalie jwangalola, boa mabatumbukila mulibomba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Petulo ngalenga, “Mutulandulile kulandanakia kwenio.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Namangwetumwe mmanyije? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bo, mmanyangitije kutenda kilebe chachoa chikijingi mukano kijenda mulutumbo na mwenakandae kupita panja kucholo? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambu ilebe eipita mukano kujenda panja iboka umwojo na yenie nga eimmeka mundu mumalemwa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gambu umwojo gaboka mawacho mabaja, na ngongola, na malaya, na kujiba, na uwangi na matukano. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Genia nga agammeka mundu kube nchapu. Nambu kulye ilyo pangakuya maboko anda apabalagila nkamulange, genia gammekaje mundu kube nchapu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imani ja amama bamwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maluko 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka paali penia ngajenda kutama kukilambo chu Kutilo na Kusidoni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Amama bamwe kabila ja Kanaani ba kilambo chenie ngabanhwikalila, ngatondabea lilobe, “Angwana, mwana jwa Daudi, umone kia! Kamwale jwango alaga na nchepela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu annyangiteje lilobe. Akinapunji bakwe ngabannyendelela, ngabannenge, “Maleke bajabule kachabe magambu butukengama kengama kupeta kuchobela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Bandumiteje nambu kunyumba ja bandu bikilambo chi Kuisilaeli abaobite andi mambelele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Penia amama benia ngabaika, nu kikileke pae ja makongono gakwe, ngabalenga, “Angwana ungole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Chwapije kutola yakulya yi ingota nu kiilekele imbwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Benia ngabajanga, “Kweli, Angwana, nambu ata imbwa kulye imbolopolo eitola kuboka pa mecha ja akaokamundu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabajanga, “Amama, imani jinu ngolongwa! Itendi uyo kwinu andi pampala.” Na kingobucho kamwale jwakwe ngalama.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamia bandu ajingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka penia ngajenda umbwega ja lilaba lya Galilaya, ngaombe pikitombi, ngatama. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi muno ngabanhwikalila, nukunnetela abalemile na bangalola na nangwaba na akabubu na bange ajingi abakiba akatamwe, ngababeka nnongi ja makongono gakwe, na jwombe Yesu ngabalamiya. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nkenga gwa bandu gwenio nguomongwa muno pababonanga akabubu bakalongela, abalemile balamite na nangwaba bakajenda na bangalola bakalolanga, bandu ngabannumba Nnoongo jwa Kuisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapeganga yakulya bandu elufu ncheche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maluko 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakema akinapunji bakwe, ngalenga, “Nabone kia bandu aba magambu babilangite pamwe nane machoba matatu, na wala bakwetangiteje chakulya. Mbaije kalekanga bajabule pangalye chakulya, ngana kuindukanga undela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabankonya, “Pamba tubi papongoti, tupata koo chakulya cha kape bandu ajingi anda aba?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Nkwetangite mikate milenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga “Saba na yamaki njoko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngabaamulicha bandu batamange pae. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ngajitola mikate saba na yamaki, ngannumba Nnoongo ngametula ngabape akinapunji, bombe ngababaganakia bandu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Boa ngabalye nukujukuta. Kuboka penia ngabalokota imbolopolo ngitwele ikapo saba. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Angweto abalilangita akinalome bakibanga elufu ncheche, pangabalanga akikege ni ingota.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu ngabatabukanga, ngabaleka nu kuombe muntumbwi, ngajenda kingonu cha kilambo cha Magadani.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bandu bapala kuibona ikobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maluko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na Masadukayo ngabannyendele Yesu, kupala kuntega ngabannyopa balaye iingi yi ikobo kuboka kumbengu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabajanga, “Anda iike kimuyo mangweto kulenga, ‘Kunanioko kubi jegwa kuba kuche gwicho, magambu kunani kukele,’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na kindabindabi kulenga, ‘Ula majikoma, magambu maunde gabi titili.’ Mangwetomwe kumanya muno iingi yu kugalambuka machoba kukulola kunani, nambu kumanyaje mangobu ganga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bandu bangoe akabaja! Bapala iingi yi ikobo, nambu kipataje kikobo chachoa ila kikobo cha Yona.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabalekanga ngajabula.</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo mabaja ga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maluko 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe kuboka pa kujomboka kwiye ja lilaba ngaba kombakela kutenda batekulibalila kupoto mikate. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Mmegange mio na ntamanga maha na maboulo mabaja ga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu angweto ngabataukana, “Balenga genia kwa magambu tupotwije mikate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya mawacho gabe, ngabalenge, “Mangwetomwe mmi na myojo michoko! Mboni nkonyana nhwalo gwangakola mikate? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bo, mmanyangiteje tango? Mmikombakeje panametula mikate nhwano magambu ga bandu elufu nhwano? Bo, makatweleya ikapo ilenga ya imbolopolo? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na mikate saba jela jabalya bandu elufu ncheche, bo, makalokota ikapo ilenga ya imbolopolo? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mboni manamanyangaje kube nongila nhwalo gu mikateje? Ntamanga maha na maboulo mabaja ga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji ngabamanya goa kube balengila batame maha na maboulo mabaja ga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo abeka kipola Yesu kube Mwana jwa Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maluko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu paika kukilambo cha papipi na Kukaisalia okwo Kufilipi, ngabakonya akinapunji bakwe, “Bandu balenga Mwana jwa Mundu nga meneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ngabannyanga, “Bange balenga mwe Yohana Mmatichi, na bange Eliya, na bange Yelemia andaje jumwe kati ja Akalondoli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Na mangweto bo, nnenga ne nabeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo ngajanga, “Mwenga nga Kilisto Mwana jwa Nnoongo ojwabi mmomi.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Mbaya mwenga Simoni mwana jwa Yona, gambu munduje ojwanhwekule kumanya kilebe chenje, nambu Awawa bango ababi kumbengu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nane nannenge mwe, Petulo, panani ja liganga lende mbakubeka kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto, na milyango ju kumambi jaotwaje. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mbakumpe mbungulo ya Kingwana chu kumbengu, chachoa champakutaba padunia nu kumbengu uyo kitabigwe, na champakulugula padunia nu kumbengu uyo kibakuluguka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabakelebuya akinapunji bakwe bakannengeje mundu kutenda jwombe nga Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alenga nhwalo gukulaga na kiu chakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maluko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuboka kingobu chenie Yesu ngatumbu kalenge kipola akinapunji bakwe, “Mpaka nyende oti Kuyelusalemu na kwenio mbakupotekigwa muno kuboke kakinanhota na akakung'i akolo na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa. Mbaukomigwa, nambu lichoba lya tatu mayoigwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Penia Petulo ngantola pantemela, ngatumbu kunkalapila, “Ikabe yeneje Angwana! Nhwalo gongo gumpataje mwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngatendebuka ngannenge Petulo, “Malichetani mmuje unyuma jango! Mwe ntenda kunhwibilikia. Mawacho ginu ga Nnoongoje nambu ga mundu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe, “Mundu jwajoa anda apala kube ndundame jwango, mpaka oti akikane mwene na aupotole nchalaba gwakwe na angengame. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gambu mundu ojwapala kukombola bwomi gwakwe mwene apakuoya, <verse number="26" style="v"/>nambu mundu ojwapakuoya bwomi gwakwe kwa magambu gango nenga, maupata. Bo, mundu apakukikonja anda apatite ile yoa ya padunia na kongo aoite bwomi gwakwe? Andaje mundu apakupanga nike kibe bada ja bwomi gwakwe? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Gambu, Mwana jwa Mundu apakuika mukibumo cha Awawa mundu pamwe na akapakachi bakwe bu kumbengu, na penia nga papakunnepa hupo yakwe kila mundu tela na itendwa yakwe. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, babile bandu upamba bijomokaje pangammona Mwana jwa Mundu akaika mukingwana chakwe.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu agalambuka kumio</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maluko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka pa machoba sita, Yesu ngabatola Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana ununagwakwe, ngabajenda nabo jika jabe mpaka kukitombi kitandamau. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwenio, pabannolekea ngabammona Yesu ngagalambuka kumio nnongi jabe, kumio jakwe ngukung'ala anda lichoba na ngobo yakwe ngibe nhuu anda lumuli. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwenio Musa na Eliya ngabapitila, ngababe bakalongela nakwe Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Penia Petulo ngannenge Yesu, “Angwana, chwapi twe kube pamba! Anda mpaile njenga iteba itatu chimwe chinu, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pakiba tango akalongela, liunde liuu ngilyaekelelanga, na lilobe ngilijoanika kuboka muliunde lyenie. “Jonjo nga Manango jwanampala, ojwanhalali mwojo, mampenakiange jwenio!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Akinapunji pabalijoa lilobe ngabagweganga manguku, ngabajogopa muno. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajendelela, ngabakunyula, ngalenga “Nnyemange, makajogopaje!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pabalola kunani bammwenije mundu, nambu Yesu jikajakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pabaulukanga pikitombi, Yesu ngabakelebuya, “Makannengeje mundu ilebe eimibweni mpaka Mwana jwa Mundu papakuyoigwa kuboka kwa abawile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuboka penia akinapunji bakwe ngabankonya Yesu, “Mboni aboli ba Malagilo ga Musa balenga kita mpaka oti Eliya aike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Kweli, Eliya atenda kuika kubeka ilebe yoa telatela. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu nannengelanga Eliya aike na bandu bammanyije, ngabantenda pabapalanga. Mwana jwa mundu apakupotekigwa uyo mumaboko gabe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji bakwe ngabamanyanga kube balandulila nhwalo gwa Yohana Mmatichi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mwana juna nchepela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maluko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pabanhwikalila kabele nkengeni gwa bandu, mundu jumwe ngannyendelela Yesu, ngakilakitila nnongi jakwe, <verse number="15" style="v"/>ngalenga “Angwana, mammone kia manango magambu akweti kiinduindu, kabe alaga muno, jwombe pa jingi agwele pamwoto nu umache. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nganalete akinapunji binu, nambu baotwije kunnamiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Mangweto mabandu banga imani! Ndama namangweto mpaka lii? Nanhwimbilila mpaka lii? Mannetange mwano pamba!” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu ngaukalapila nchepela, na gwenio nguboka na mwana ngalama kingobucho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuboka penia akinapunji ba ngabannyendelela Yesu kuntemela, ngabankonya, “Mboni twe tuotwije kuuboya nchepela gola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Kwa magambu nkwetije imani.” Nanenge kweli makabi na imani njokochoko andi mbeju ya aladali kabi nhwotolinge kukilenge kitombi, “Mmoke pamba nnyende papa, na chenie kujenda. Makaotolinge ukamwa kila kilebe!” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nambu genia kuwechekanaje mpaka kupunga na kugongalela.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonge kabele nhwalo gwa kiu chakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pabakiba pamwe okwo kikilambo cha Galilaya, Yesu ngabalengela, “Mwana jwa Mundu ajenda ukamuigwa ku bandu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bapankoma nambu lichoba lya itatu mayoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">Akinapunji ngabaechuka muno.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulepa kodi ja nyumba ja kugongalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pabaika kukilambo cha Kafalanaumu bandu ba ukongola uloi gwa kodi ja Nyumba ja Nnoongo ngabanyendelela Petulo, ngabankonya “Bo, Aboli binu babi kulepa kodi?” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Petulo ngajanga, “Umwo, babi kulepa.”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo pajingila unyumba, tango nukulongeje, Yesu ngankonya, “Simoni mwe nnolabo? Mangwana ga padunia gakongola kodi kuboka kubeneke? Kuboka kwa akakola Kilambo andaje kuboka kwa akageni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Petulo ngajanga, “Kuboka kwa akageni” Yesu ngannengela,</para>
  <para style="p">“Aja ngayene, akakola Kilambo bapaligweje kulepa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nambu kukupala bakachimwaje, nnyende kulilaba makabeke ndoana, ntola chamaki ju kutumbula kolwa nhwekula kano jakwe, na nkati mukolela uloi tela na kulepa kodi. Ntola kwa magambu gangu nenga na magambu ginu mwenga.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bene ababi akolongwa?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie akinapunji ngabannyendelela Yesu, ngabankonya, “Bene ababi akolongwa kukingwana cha kumbengu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu ngankema mwana jumwe, ngannyemeka nnongi jabe, <verse number="3" style="v"/>penia ngalenga, “Nannenge kweli, anda nu kugalambukaje nukube andi ingota, nnyingije Mukingwana cha kumbengu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jwajoa ojwakibeka nuu mwene nukube andi mwana ojo, nga nkolongwa mukingwana chu kumbengu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Jwajoa ojwampokela mwana jumwe andi ojo ku liina lyango, amboke nenga.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulondoigwa mumabaja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maluko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Jwajoa ojwapa kukunnyambuki jumwe jwa akachoko kujileka imani, ikabi mbaya bantabalile liganga lya kuyagila muntandala nu kuntumbukia mubaali.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="18:6">Bandu abena batenda kuyaga piliganga </figure> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kabe nnyo mabandu bapadunia kabeke ipengu bandu abajeketile na bange buleke mojo! Ipengu mpaka ipitile nambu kulaga kwa mundu jwenio ojwapakijambuki ipitile!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Anda luboko andaje lukongono lwinu lupakummeka ipengu, muluekete nu kululeke kutaali! Mbaya kwinu kujingila mubwomi manga luboko au lukongono telaje nu kulekeligwa pamwoto gwa ngaimika machoba goa pangapela, kongo mmi na maboko na makongono goa mabele. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na lio linu anda lipa kumpeleya, muliboye nulekela kutaali na mwe. Mbaya mwe kujingi mubwomi mmi na chongo, telaje nu kulekeligwa pamwoto gwangaimika machoba goa kongo mmi na mio goa mabele.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na limbelele iliobite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Ntama maha! Makammembulaje jumwe kati ja angwetwa achoko. Nannenge, Akapakachi babe ba kumbingu babilangite kila kingobu nnongi ja Awawa ababi Kumbengu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gambu Mwana jwa mundu aika kakombolanga abaobite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Nnolanga bo? Mundu anda akweti mambelele mia jimwe, anda liobite limwe, atenda bo? Kugaleka gaga makomi tisa na tisa kukitombi, kujenda kulipala lyale eliobite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Anda alipatite, nannenge kweli, apakuala mwojo muno kupeta tisini na tisa gangaoba na tisa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Uyo, Awawa binu ba Kumbengu kupalaje kuoba najumweje panakati angwetwa akachoko.</para>
  <para style="s">Nnyinu anda lemwite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luka 17:3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mundu anda annemwite, munyendelele muka nkelebuye kiti mmilangite makangweto jika. Anda anyoine mumpatite nnyinu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Anda anyoineje, muntola mundu jumwe au abena pamwe na mwe kupala kwa malobe ga akachaili abena andaje atatu kila kilebe kiba tela. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Anda kunyowangaje mangweto, mikilengala kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto. Na aba kwinu andi mundu jwanga mmanya Nnoongo na akatocha kodi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kanakia nu kujeketela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nannenge kweli, champakutaba padunia nu kumbengu uyo kitabigwe, na champakulugula padunia nu kumbengu uyo kibakuluguka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Kabe nannenge, makabena anda nnyeketaline padunia pano kukilebe chachoa champakujopa kilebechenie Awawa bango ba kumbengu mabatenda kilebe chenie. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mana papoa pala pabakongana abena au atatu kwa liina lyango, nne mbi upo panakati jinu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na mpakachi jwanga nnekekea nnyakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Petulo ngannyendelela Yesu, ngankonya, “Angwana, bo nnunugwango anda anemwite nannekekeya palenga? Pasaba?” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga, “Nnenga pasaba tuje,” nambu pasaba mala pasabini. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nga magambu Kingwana chu kumbengu kilandine na Nngwana jumwe ojwakagula ichabu ya akapakachi bakwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Patumbula kagula, ngabannetela mundu jumwe juna ligambo lya talanta elufu komi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mundu jwenio akwetije chukulepa, penie Angwana ngabaamulicha auchigwe, jwenio na aanamundu, ingota ni ilebe yoa eyakweti, kupala ligambo lilepigwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Penia, mpakachi jwenio ngakilikatila nnongi jabe ngalenga, “ ‘Nhwimbalile, ne manannepa ligambo lyango lyoa.’ ” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Angwana benia ngabankole kia, ngabannekekeya ligambo lyoa, ngabanneka ajabule kachake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nambu mpakachi jwenio ngaboka, ngankolela mpakachi nnyakwe ojwakiba ni ligambo nakwe dinali mya jimwe. Ngankamula pantandala ngalenga, ‘Nnepe ligambo linu!’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mpakachi nnyakwe jwenio ngakilikatila ngannyopa, ‘Nhwimbalile nanji manannepage.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu jwenio ajeketileje ngabantaba mikipungo mpaka papakulepa ligambo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Akapakachi ajabe pabagabona ngabakokaleka muno, ngabajenda kalenge Angwanamundu nhwalo gwenio. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Penia Angwana ba ngabankema mpakachi jola, ngaba nnenge, ‘Mwenga mapakachi mabaja muno!’ Ngunyopa, nane ngununekekeya ligambo linu lyoa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>‘Bo, ipaligweje namwe kummone kia mpakachi nnyinu andi ne panankolila kia.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Penia Angwana benia ngabachimwa muno, ngabantaba mukipungo mpaka papakulepa ligambo lyoa.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngajomole kulenga, “Yene uyo Awawa bango bukumbengu pabapa kuntenda kila mundu anda kalekekea akajinu kumwojo gwinu gwoa.”</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akelebuya lukobo lwa kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maluko 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pajomola kulenga malobe genia, ngaboka kukilambo chuku Galilaya, ngajenda kukilambo chuku Yudea, kwiye ja lukemba lwa Yolidani. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkenga gwa bandu ngugunkengama kwenio, jwombe ngabalamiyanga abakiba ni itamwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gange Mafalisayo ngaganhwikalila, ngagajiga kunkonya kukuntega, “Bo, ipaligwije mundu kaleka aanamundu kwa malemwa gagoa gala?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bo, nchomangiteje Majandiko Gachwapi kutenda pukutumbula Nnoongo ojwampangania mundu akammeka munalome nu munkege. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Penia Nnoongo ngalenga, ‘Kwa magambu genia mundu baleka awamundu na amamundu, aba pamwe na aanamundu, na benia baba bamwe.’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nayene benia abena kabeje nambu mmele gumwe. Bai chalondine Nnoongo mundu akikilekaniaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu Mafalisayo ngagankonya, “Mboni Musa atujeketile analome kaandaki talaka aanamundu na kaleka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Musa annyeketile kaleka akaanabinu magambu gu kujundupa kwa myojo jinu. Nambu ikiba yeneje kingobu cha pangania dunia. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nannengelanga, mundu jwajwoa anda balekite aanamundu nukutola bange atenda ngongola, nambu kwale ibe munkege jwenio akiba nngongola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe ngabannengela, “Anda ibi yene nhwalo gwa analome na akege, mbaya ukotoka kutola akege.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Boaje abaotwile kulipokela lilobe lyene, nambu baba tu Nnoongo ababekigwe kutama uwolo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Gambu ibi ilebe ijingi ibabeka bandu bakotoke kutola akege, bange kwa magambu kibelekwa, bange kwa magambu ga bandu babekite kube yenela, na bange baamulinge bene akangweto kutolaje akege kwa magambu ga Kingwana cha Kumbengu. Ojwaotwile kulipokela lilobe lyenie alipokela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aibekela maboko ingota ichokoichoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabannetela ingota ichokoichoko aibeke maboko aigongalele, nambu akinapunji bakwe ngabaikelebuya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Mileke ingota iike kwango mikiikanakiaje, magambu Kingwana cha kumbengu cha bandu ababi andi ingota yene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngaibeke maboko kuboka penia ngaboka penia.</para>
  <para style="s">Kakombo juna uloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mundu jumwe nganhwikalila Yesu, ngankonya, “Aboli, ndenda kilebe nike chambone nupate bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu gannengela, “Mboni mwe ungonya nhwalo gwa kilebe echikibi chambone? Abi jumwe tu jwambone. Andampala kujingila mubwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela magajali malagilo ga Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mundu jola ngankonya, “Malagilo gako?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajanga, “Makakomaje na ngongolaje na makajibaje na makabe machaili ba unhwangije, <verse number="19" style="v"/>majoe awabinu na amabinu, na mumpale nndami nnyinu anda pimikipala mmene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kakombo jwenio ngannenge Yesu, “Genia goa nagaagabile, ndenda nike chenge?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Andampaile kube telatela, nnyende makauche ilebe inu uloi gwene makape akaocho namwe mamma na nkoba kumbengu, kuboka penia nhwika ungengame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kakombo pagajoa genia, ngajabula kachakwe na kongo achimwite magambu akiba nuloi muno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Nannenge kweli ipakube kujundupa muno kwa mundu juna uloi kujingila mukingwana chu kumbengu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kabe nannenge kindema muno ngamia kupeta pililanga lya chingana, kumpeta mundu juna uloi kujingi mukingwana chu kumbengu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Akinapunji bala pabajoa genia ngabaomongwa muno ngabankonya Yesu, “Nga meneke ojwapakuoto ukomboka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalolakeya, ngabajanga, “Kwa bandu kilebe chenje kuwechakanaje, nambu ku Nnoongo ilebe yoa kuwechakana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Petulo ngalenga, “Natwe bo? Tuilekite ilebe ito yoa tunkengime mwenga! Tubakupata nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Nannenge kweli, Mwana jwa Mundu papakutama pikitebu chu kutawala chi kibumo chakwe Padunia Nhyono, mangwetomwe mangengaminge ntamanga muitebu komi ni ibele makagahukumula makabi komi na mabena ga kilambo cha Kuisilaeli. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na mundu jwajoa jwajilekite nyumba andaje akanuna mundu andaje akalombo andaje awawa andaje amama andaje ingota andaje migonda, kwa magambu gangu nenga, mapokela mala pa mia muno na maipata bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu ababi bukutumbula ngoe mababa bukujomolela, na ababi bukujomolela mababa bukutumbula.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Akakamu mahengo munng'onda gwa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Kingwana chu kumbengu kilandine andi yene. Mundu nkola nng'onda gwa mizabibu, jwenio ngaboka kindabi kilokilo kabeka bandu akamwa maengo mung'onda gwakwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngapangana nabo kalepa uloi kulichoba penia ngabapeleka kunng'onda gwa mizabibu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ngaboka kindabi saa tatu, ngababona bange bandu bajemite kuchoko, banga mahengo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngabalenge, ‘Nnyendange na mangweto makakamu mahengo munng'onda gwango nenga manannepa pipaligwe.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ngabajabula.</para>
  <para style="p">“Bena akola nng'onda ngababoka kabele saa sita na saa tisa, ngabatenda uyo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na kimuyo saa komi na jimwe, ngababoka kabele, ngabakolela bandu bajemite pachoko pala. Ngabakonyanga, ‘Mboni nnyemangite pambano mui joa na chankamwaje?’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Na ngweto ngabajanga, ‘Kwa magambu abije mundu jukutupe mahengo.’ Bombe ngabalenge, ‘Namangweto nnyendange kunng'onda gwango gwa mizabibu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Apiika kimuyo, akola nng'onda ngabannenge ojwabeka uloi gwabe, ‘Makeme akamwa mahengo malepange uloi gwabe, katumbula ababakabe bukujomolela, na kajomolela abatumbalaga.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ngabaikanga abakemigwa saa komi na jimwe, ngabapokela kila mundu uloi gwakwe gwa lichoba limwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Abatumbula bala pabaika, bapemelela bapata tondoba. Nambu nangweto ngabapata uyo uloi gwa lichoba limwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pabapokela uloi gwabe, ngabatumbu kakokalakea akola nng'onda. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngabalenga, ‘Bandu bamba abamakemita bukujomolela bakamula mahengo kukingobu cha saa jimwe tu, mboni mutubekite tela nabombe natwe tuimbalile liengo linakanonopa mui joa na lumu?’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Nambu ngabannyanga jumwe katijabe, ‘Aganja, namponjiteje. Bo, tulagineje kunnepa uloi gwa lichoba limwe? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ntole uloi gwinu, nnyabule. Mbala kunnepa uyo mundu jukujomolela kunkema tela na mwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bo, mbaligwije ukamwa genia muloi gwango pambala? Bo, umone lwina magambu ne mbi namwojo gwa mbone?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngajomole kulenga, “Yene, ababi bukujomolela ngoe bapakube bukutumbula na bukutumbula bapakube bukujomolela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alandulila mala ja patatu nhwalo gwa kiu chakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu pakiba akajenda kukilambo cha Kuyelusalemu, ngabatola akinapunji komi na abele bala kuntemela, undela ngabalengela, <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mpenakiange! Tujenda Kuyelusalemu, na kwenio Mwana jwa Mundu apabakamuigwa kwa akakung'i akolo na akaboli ba Malagilo, na angweto bapa kunhukumu akomigwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bapankamuya kwa bandu bangabe Akayahudi bapa mmekanga nhwenyo, aputigwe bokola na bapankoma kukummamba panchalaba, nambu lichoba lya tatu mayoigwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kujopa kwa amama ba Yakobo na Yohana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maluko 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Penia aanaba Zebedayo ngabannyendele Yesu bakiba pamwe ningota yabe, ngabakilakitila nu kunnyopa kilebe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Bo, mpala nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">Amama benia ngabajanga, “Unengele kube ingota yango ibena yeno maitama jumwe kalelo na jonge kangeja mu Kingwana chiinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ngaijanga ikakombo “Mmanyije nnyopanga ni. Bo, nhwotwile kunywe kikombe cha malago chambakunywe nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabannyanga, “Tuotwile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Kweli manywa kikombe chango, nambu kutama kalelo andaje kangeja liengo lyangoje kubeka, kilebe chenia mabapata babala ababekiligwe tayali na Awawa bango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pabajoa genia akinapunji bange komi bala, ngaba chimwanga benia akabena. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yene Yesu ngabakemanga boa ngalenga, “Mmanyi kube akiilongoi ba bandu ba ilambo batawala bandu babe kwa makakala, na akiilongoi babe bakweti amuli ngolongwa kwabe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nambu mangwetomwe ikabe yeneje. Nambu mundu ojwapala kube nkolongwa panakati jinu abe oti mpakachi jwa mmoa, <verse number="27" style="v"/>na mundu ojwapala kube jukutumbula, panakati jinu mpaka oti abe mmanda jwinu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Na uyo ne Mwana jwa Mundu nhikila kutumikigwaje, nambu kutumika na kuboya bwomi gwango ibe nakombole bandu ajingi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamiya bangalola akabena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu paboka kukilambo cha Yeliko na akinapunji bakwe, nkengeni nkolongwa gwa bandu ngugunkengama. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Penia pakiba na bangalola akabena batamangite umbwega ja undela, na pabajoa kube Yesu apeta penia, ngabatondabeya lilobe. “Angwana, Mwana jwa Daudi, mutubone kia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nkenga gwa bandu ngugwakalapila na kalenge bakotokange. Nambu angweto ngabayanga kuchobela, “Angwana, Mwana jwa Daudi, mutubone kia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu ngajema, ngabakemanga na kakonya, “Mpalanga nantendelange nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ngabannyanga, “Angwana, tujopa tuoto kulola!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngababone kia ngabakunyula mio gabe, na kingobu ucho ngabaotolanga kulola, ngabankengama.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajingila Kuyelusalemu ku ilulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe pababandakila Kuyelusalemu na kuika ku Betifage pi kitombi cha Mizeituni, ngabakinga akinapunji bakwe abele, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ngabalengela, “Nnyendange mpaka kukijiji echikibi nnongi jinu na mamilikolela liponda litabigwe na mwana jwakwe magakulugule na magalete kwango. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Anda mundu ankonyangite, munnengela, bagapala Angwana, jwombe mannekelanga kingobucho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kile chenje kipitila kupala gaga agalengigwe na nnondoli jwa Nnoongo galenganile,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Mikilengele kilambo cha Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q">Nnole, Nngwana gwinu atendakuika!</para>
  <para style="q">Juna kia na aliombi liponda,</para>
  <para style="q">mwana liponda, mwana jwa liponda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yene, akinapunji bala ngabajabulanga ngabakamwa anda Yesu apabalagalinge. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngibilitola liponda lela na mwana jwakwe, ngabatandika ngobo yabe panani ji liponda na Yesu ngatama panani jakwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nkenga nkolongwa gwa bandu ngabatandika ngobo yabe undela, na bandu bange ngabatema matutwe ngabagajanjaya undela. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nkenga gwa bandu abakiba nnongi ja Yesu na abakiba unyuma ngabatumbu kutondabe lilobe kulenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Alumbigwe Mwana jwa Daudi!</para>
  <para style="q">Abe ni kindimba ojwaika ku liina lya Angwana!</para>
  <para style="q">Alumbigwe Nnoongo kunani kumbengu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu paika Kuyelusalemu, bandu boa ba kilambo chenie ngababe ni kijonga, ngaba konyana, “Ojo nga meneke?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Bandu abakiba pankengeni gwenio ngabalenga, jwenio nga nnondoli Yesu kuboke ku Nazaleti kukilambo cha ku Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda mu Nyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu ngajingi mu Nyumba ja Nnoongo, ngababenga bandu abakiba bakaucha nu kuemela ilebe mwenio. Ngapendangula mecha ya abajangangana uloi, na itebu ya abauchanga njeba, <verse number="13" style="v"/>ngabalengelanga, “Iandikigwe mumajandiko Gachwapi, Nnoongo alengite Nyumba jango jikemigwa nyumba ja kugongalela. ‘Nambu mangweto mijibeka kube nyumba jakajibi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bangalola na nangwaba ngaba nnyendelela Yesu ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo, Yesu ngabalamiya. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo na aboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabachimwanga apabagabona gukuomongwa agakamula Yesu na kabe ingota apainonoya malobe mu Nyumba ja Nnoongo balenga, “Alumbigwe Mwana jwa Daudi.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nhyene ngabankonya Yesu, “Bo, nnyoaje echibalongela?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabajanga, “Elo, mbetakujoa! Bo manachomaje mumajandiko gangano?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mibolangite ingota na ilemba,</para>
  <para style="q">mpakupata ukoigwa okukulenganile.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngabaleka, ngapita panja ja kilambo nu kujenda ku Betania, ngagoloka kwenio.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aulapanakia nkongo ogukemigwa ntini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maluko 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba akabuja ku nnyini kindabindabi, ngabe na njala. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ngaubona nkongo ntini umbwega ja ndela ngaujendelela, nambu aukolela gwanga ngoko nambu maamba tu. Penia ngaulengela, “Makapambikaje kabe ngoko pangapela!” Kingobu ucho nkongo gwenio ngujoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Akinapunji apabaubona ngabaomongwa bakalenga, “Mboni nkongo ntini gola ujomite kukingobu tu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Kweli nannengelanga, anda mmilingite ni imani panga mbwele, nhwotwile kutenda ngiti yene tuje, nambu ata mikikilengi kitombi chenje, ‘Nnyikuke mikikileke mubaali,’ Maiba uyo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na anda mmi kuamini, chochoa echimpakujopa kukugongalela, mampata.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bakonya nhwalo gwa madalaka ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngajingi Munyumba ja Nnoongo, ngababolanga. Apakiba akabola, akakung'i akolo na akinanhota ngabankonya, “Nkamwa ile yenje kukinala gani? Bene abampi kinala chenie?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Na nenga mbakunkonya kilebe chimwe, anda unyangangite, na nenga nannyanga ndenda ikobo yenje kukinala gani. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nankonyanga yene, bo, uwecho gwa Yohana gu kubaticha uboka kwa bene? Bo, uboka ku Nnoongo andaje kubandu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu ngabatumbu kutaukana beneakangweto jika, “Anda tulengite, ‘Uboka kumbengu,’ Apakutukonya, ‘Mboni nhwaminingije?’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Andatulengite, ‘Ubokita kubandu,’ Tujogopa nkengeni gwa bandu magambu boa bajeketalinge kube Yohana nga nnondoli.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Penia, ngabannyanga Yesu, “Tumanyije.”</para>
  <para style="p">Jwombe Yesu ngabalengela, “Nane uyo nannengeje ngamwa ilebe yenje kukinala gani.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa ingota ibele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mangweto nnolangabo? Mundu jumwe akiba na ingota ibele. Ngannengelanga jwajo jwa kutumbula, ‘Manango, lele nnyende makakamu maengo kunng'onda gwa mizabibu.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kakombo jwenio ngabalengela, ‘Ngana!’ Nambu mwenakandae ngagalambuya mawacho, ngajenda ukamu mahengo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Awawa bala ngabannengela mwana jwabe jwa pili uyo, jwombe ngajanga, ‘Elo awawa manyabulage!’ Nambu ajeije kamu mahengo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bo, mene kati ja abele ojwakalenganakia gabapala awawa mundu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Jwajo mwana jwakutumbula.”</para>
  <para style="p">Penia, Yesu ngabalengela, “Kweli nannengelanga, akatocha kodi na bina ngongola bapakunnongalela kujingila mu Kingwana cha Nnoongo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Magambu Yohana ngaika kwinu kunnaya kutenda gapala Nnoongo, namangweto munhwaminije, nambu akajopa kodi na akangongola ngabannyeketela. Nambu magabweni genia goa, mangweto nng'ambwikeje mumyojo jinu, na nnyeketelingije.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa nnemi na nng'onda gwa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Mpenikiange kulandanakia konge. Mundu jumwe juna nyumba ngalema nng'onda gwa mizabibu, ngautindikia ubego na ngaemba liliba lya ukamangila zabibu na uyo ngachenga kilendo mwenio. Kubokapenia ngabajaika akalemi, ngajenda mwanja kujenda kilambo cha kutaali. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kingobu cha mauno apachaika, ngabakinga akapakachi bakwe kwa akalemi bala, batolange lipungu lyabe lya mauno. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Akalemi bala ngabapukilanga akapakachi benia, jumwe ngabamputa na jonge ngabankoma na jonge ngabamputa mabwe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mundu jwenio ngabakinga kabe akabanda bange, bakiba nduu kupeta mwanja gwa kutumbula. Akalemi bala ngabatenda uyayela. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pukujomolela ngankinga mwana jwakwe kongo akawacha, ‘Pangaje mabannyoa manango.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nambu akalemi bala apabammona mwanajwabe ngabalengelana bombe ku bombe, ‘Jonjo nga nnichi, tankome ibe tutole ulichi gwakwe!’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Penia, ngabampukila, ngabampia panja ja nng'onda gwenio gwa mizabibu, ngabankoma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Ngoe, jwenio nkola nng'onda gwa mizabibu, apapakuika, apakakamwa ni akalemi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bombe ngabannyanga, “Apakakoma akabaja benia, na nng'onda gola apakape akalemi bange abapampe lipungu lya mauno kingobu cha mauno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabalengelanga, “Bo, nchomangitije kile chenje Mumajandiko Gachwapi?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Libwe elibilikanangite akachengi</para>
  <para style="q">ngoe nga libwe likolongwa lyambone.</para>
  <para style="q">Angwana nga abatei kile chenje,</para>
  <para style="q">kabe kilebe chenie nga chukuomongwa muno kwito!’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Ku yene nannengela, Kingwana cha Nnoongo makiboigwa kwinu na kape bandu ba ilambo yenge ina kupambika ngoko agapala Nnoongo.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mundu anda agweli panani ja libwe lende apakutwekuka ipande, nambu ojulipakung'welela lipa kuntimba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo na Mafalisayo apabajoa kulandanakia kwakwe ngabamanya kutenda balenga angweto. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Penia ngabapalapala ndela ja kumpukila, nambu bajogopanga bandu gambu angweto bamanyi kutenda jwenio akiba nnondoli jwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na mpapala gwa kutolana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngalongela nabo kabele kukulandanakia, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Kingwana cha kumbengu kilandine yene, nngwana akampanganakia mwana jwakwe munalome mpapala gwa kutolana. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ngabatuma akapakachi kakemanga bandu abakakokigwe kumpapala, nambu bandu abakokigwe bapailingeje kuika. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngabakinga kabe akapakachi bange, akalenga, ‘Makalengele abakokigwe, ilyo yango ibi tayali ngoe, likambako lya ng'ombe ni likoga lina kunoga lichinjigwe, kila kilebe kibi tela, nhwikange kumpapala!’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambu bandu abakokigwe baagabije na ngabajabulanga kachabe, jumwe kung'onda gwakwe na jonge kamaengo gakwe, <verse number="6" style="v"/>na bange ngabapukila akabanda bala ngabatukana, ngaba komanga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nngwana jola ngachimwa muno, ngagakinga manjolinjoli gakwe bakakomange akakomi benia na kukijocha kilambo chabe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Penia ngabalengela akapakachi bakwe, ‘Ilyo ya mpapala ibi tela kweli, nambu abakokigwe bapaligweje. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ngoe nnyendange kundela na baboa bala abampa kakolela makemange baike kumpapala.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akapakachi bala ngababoka, ngabajenda ku nnyini, ngabaleta bandu boa, abaja na bambone. Nyumba ja mpapala ngijitwelela akageni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nngwana apajingila kalola akageni, ngammona mundu jumwe ojwakwinditeje ngobo ya mpapala. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nngwana ngankonya, ‘Maganja, nnyingilabo pamba panga ngobo ja mpapala?’ Nambu jwombe ngatama nuu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Penia nngwana ngabalengela akapakachi, ‘Mantabange makongono na maboko makannekele panja pulubendu, kwenio apakuguta nu kuyaga mino.’ ” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ngajomolela kulongela, “Ajingi bakokigwe, nambu achoko bapambuligwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulepa kodi kwa Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kubokapenia, Mafalisayo ngabajabulanga, ngabapangana ndela ja kunyonja Yesu kwa malobe gakwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Penia, ngabakinga akinapunji babe pamwe na abankengama Helode. Ngabankonya, “Aboli, tumanyi kutenda mwenga nga mamundu mannonge kweli, nu kutenda mmola kweli ja ndela ja Nnoongo, kunnyogopaje mundu jwajoa, gambu liengo lya mundu nga kileje kwinu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mutulengele lele nnolabo, tupaligwa kulepa kodi kwa nkolongwa jwa Loma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngamanya mawacho gabe mabaja, ngabalengela, “Mangweto mamikitenda mabandu ba mbone, mboni unyiganga kupala unyonjange? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Unayange uloi gwa kulepa kodi.” Angweto ngabampikia uloi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Kumio kwa beneke na liina lyabeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ngabannyanga, “Ja nkolongwa jwa Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">Penia Yesu ngabalengela, “Tela, mampe nkolongwa jwa Loma agabi gakwe nkolongwa jwa Loma, na ga Nnoongo mampe Nnoongo.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apabajoa yene ngabaomongwa, ngabanneka na ngabajabulanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gwa kuyoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lichoba lyene, Masadukayo abalenga abawile bayokaje ngabannyendele Yesu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ngabannenge, “Aboli, Musa alenga mundu andawile na kaleka akege gwangabe na mwana, nnung'una mundu batole malekwe, kupala bampotole nnung'una gwakwe ingota. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ngoe, pito pano pakiba na akalongo saba. Jwa kutumbula ngatola munkege kuboka penia ngawe panga kube na ingota, ngannekela nnongamundu munkege nanhwele jwenio. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ngibe uyo nnongamundu jonge, na jwa tatu mpaka jwa saba. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuboka pa akalongo benia boa kuwe, munkege jola uyo ngawe. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Bo, lichoba lya kuyoka abawile akege benia mababa anhanaba beneke kati ja akalongo saba bala? Gambu boa saba ngabantola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mangweto ntekulemwa magambu magamanyije Majandiko Gachwapi na makakala ga Nnoongo! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nambu lichoba li kuyoka bandu mababa anda akapakachi bu kumbengu, batolaje akege wala kutoligwaje na analome. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nambu nhwalo gu kuyoka abawile, manachomangaje agannengalinge Nnoongo? Annengalinga, <verse number="32" style="v"/>‘Nenga na Nnoongo ba Ulaimu na Isaka na Yakobo.’ Jwenio ngiti Nnoongo jwa abawileje nga Nnoongo jwa ababi bwomi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nkenga gwa bandu gwenio apaujoa yene nguomongwa maboulo gakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ngolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maluko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mafalisayo apabajoa Masadukayo bakwetingitije kilebe chenge chikunkonya Yesu, ngabakongana pamwe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Jumwe kati jabe, mmoli jwa Malagilo ga Musa, ngankonya Yesu kukuntega, <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Aboli, amuli jako ejibi ngolongwa mu Malagilo ga Musa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “ ‘Mapale Angwana Nnoongo jwinu ku mojo gwinu gwoa na kukiuke chinu choa na kwa malango ginu goa.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Jenje nga amuli ngolongwa ja kutumbula. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Japabele jilandana na jenie, ‘Mampale nndami nnyinu anda apamikipala mmene.’ <verse number="40" style="v"/>Malagilo goa ga Musa na majandiko ga akalondoli ba Nnoongo gahyobalela amuli yenje ibena.”</para>
  <para style="s">Malagano ga Nnoongo nhwalo gwa Kilisto nkomboi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mafalisayo apabakongana pamwe, Yesu ngabakonyanga, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Mangweto nnolangabo nhwalo gwa Kilisto nkomboi? Bo, nga Mwana jwa beneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Mwana jwa Daudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Kubabole kwa makakala gu Uhuke jwa Chwapi, Daudi ankema jwombe Angwana? Gambu ngalenga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>‘Angwana ngabalengela Angwana bango,</para>
  <para style="q">ntame kingonu chango cha kalelo,</para>
  <para style="q">mpaka nabekange akangondwa binu pae ja makongono ginu.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Anda, ibi, Daudi ankema Kilisto Nkomboi ‘Angwana,’ Baotwabo kube mwana gwakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Abije mundu jwajoa ojwakaotola kunnyanga lilobe. Nu kuboka lichoba ulyo abije ojwakajiga kabe kunkonya kilebe.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Malago</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maluko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngaulenge nkengeni gwa bandu pamwe na akinapunji bakwe, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Akaboli ba Malagilo na Mafalisayo bakweti uwecho gwa kulenganakia Malagilo ga Musa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mapenikiange nu kamula goa gabapa kunnengela. Nambu makajigaje itendwa yabe, gambu babikulenganikiaje gabatangacha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kutaba minhigo mitopeu na katweka bandu mumapamba, nambu benia angweto bakanite nu kutondabea lukonji bijipotole. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Angweto bakamulanga ilebe yabe yoa kupala babonange bandu. Bakwindanga lumundi eilembigwe Majandiko Gachwapi muibongi na mumaboko gabe, nu kuchonela nducha miniko ya makoti gabe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kupala paali pina ichima mumipapala na itebu eibekigwe nnongi mumajumba gu kugongalela. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kupala kalamukia kakinanhota mungongano nu kupala ukemigwa na bandu, ‘Aboli.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu mangweto makakemigwaje ngu ‘Aboli.’ Gambu aboli binu bamwe na mangweto mmowa makalongo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na mukankemaje mundu jwa jwoa ‘Awawa’, Padunia pano, gambu Awawa binu bamwe tu ababi kumbengu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na makakemigwaje ‘Makilongoi,’ Gambu kilongoi jwinu jumwetu nga Kilisto Nkomboi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ojwabi nkolongwa panakati jinu abe oti mpakachi jwinu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ojwa kitondobe Nnoongo aba kunhuluya, na ojwa kiuluya Nnoongo aba kuntondobea.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bakola bandu ababikitenda bambone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maluko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga makaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mamikitenda kube mambone! Nnyigalanga nniango gu kingwana chu kumbengu kubandu abapakujingi mukingwana chi kumbengu. Mmene mangweto kujingije mwenio, nambu maibilikia abapala kujingi mwenio.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kupotekigwa akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mamikibeka bambone! Kaponjanga akananhwele nu kukikopekeya kube mabandu bambone kwa kugongalela kwinu kukoola. Kwa magambu genia mpakupata hukumu ngolongwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga akaboli ba Malagilo na Mafalisayo, bandu mamikibeka bambone! Ntyanganga mubaali nu mwilambo yoa kupala mumpate mundu aamini andi punhwamini mmene mangweto, pamampata mummeka abe jukujenda kumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa kupeta mmene mangweto!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga akalongoi bangalola! Mangweto nnenga ‘Kita mundu anda alapile ku nyumba ja Nnoongo, kilapi chenie nhwaloje, nambu anda ajilapile jaabu ja Munyumba ja Nnoongo, kilapi chenie kiunamatile.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mangweto makajinga mangalola! Chako chikibi chambone muno, jaabu andaje Nyumba ja Nnoongo ejibeka jaabu kube chwapi? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kabe nnenga ‘Kita mundu anda akilapali kitembe cha Nnoongo nhwaloje nambu anda alilapali lilumbo elibekigwe panani ja kitembe cha Nnoongo kilapi chenie kiunamatile.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mangweto mangalola! Chako chikibi chambone muno, lilumbo lela andaje kitembe cha Nnoongo chikibeka lilumbo kube chwapi? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ojwa lapalila kitembe cha Nnoongo akilapalila kitembe chenie pamwe na ilebe yoa eibekigwe panani jakwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ojwa jilapali nyumba ja Nnoongo ajilapili nyumba ja Nnoongo pamwe na Nnoongo ojwabi mwenio. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ojwajilapalila mbengu akilapalila kitebu cha kingwana cha Nnoongo, na jwatamila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga makaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mamikitenda mambone! Ntochanga bandu lipungu lya komi, ni itimbilo andi yene maamba gina kunungila na manjanu na kongo milekanga ilebe yambone ya Malagilo andi yene haki, kia, na imani. Genie nga agapaligwe kugaagabala na gange. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Makilongoi mangalola! Kuboya libembe mukunywe, nambu kumila ngamia!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga makaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mikitenda mambone! Kujeleya ikombe na ntungati kunja, nambu nkati mukuleka kutweli ilebe iyampatangita ku upoki na ubaja. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mafalisayo mangalola! Nnyeleye oti kikombe nkati na kunja mapaba chwapi uyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga makaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo mikibeka kube mambone! Mmilingite andi makabuli agapakaigwe chwakala panja gabonekana chwapi nambu nkati gatweli iyupa ya mitui na kila ikokoloko ichapu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nu uyo, mangweto mmonekana na bandu kunja andi mabandu bambone nambu nkati ntwelalinge ubaja.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondola lichoba lyabe lya hukumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Mpakulaga makaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Mafalisayo mikibeka mabandu bambone! Nchengele makabuli gakalondoli na kugalembekeya makabuli ga bandu bambone. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nnenga, ‘Kita twe tukabi kingobu cha kaokabito tukabi pamweje kakomanga akalondoli!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yene nchalakichanga mmene kutenda mangweto nga ingota ya bandu ababakomangita akalondoli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Aja, nnyomolekeange liengo lela elibatumbula akaokabinu! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mangweto majoka ni ingota ya majoka gina uchungu! Nhwechangabo kujepa hukumu ja mwoto gwangaimika machoba goa? <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ne nannetelanga mangweto akalondoli na bandu bina malango na akaboli, na bange mpakakomanga na kabambanga munchalaba na bange mpakaputa iboko munyumba inu yu kugongalela na kapalapala muilambo yoa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kulaga kubakuika kwinu magambu ga myai ja bandu boa bambone ejijitigwe panani ja nnema. Kuboke ukomigwa kwa Abeli ojwakiba jwanga malemwa, mpaka ukomigwa kwa Zakalia, mwana jwa Balakia, ojumunkoma panakati ja pachwapi ni kitembe chukupangi lilumbo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, kwa magambu ga ukoma kwinu, mabandu ba ngoe mpa kuhukumuligwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapaile bandu ba kilambo cha Kuyelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Mwe ma Yelusalemu, Mwe ma Yelusalemu! Makomanga akalondoli na kaputa maganga akapakachi ba Nnoongo abakingite kwinu! Palenga nyigite kuikongola ingota yinu kwango andi ngoko apaikongola yana yakwe nkati ja mapapanilo gakwe, nambu mapaije. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Na nyumba ja Nnoongo jwinu jilekigwa liami. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, umonaje kabe mpaka apampa kulenga, ‘Alumbigwe ojwaika kuliina lya Angwana.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela kubomoligwa kwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maluko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka pa Nyumba ja Nnoongo, na apakiba akajabula, akinapunji bakwe ngabannyendelela, ngabannaya majumba genia kichenga chabachengite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Tela,” Nhwotolinge kugalolakea goa gano! Nannengela kweli, “Libije ata liganga limwe elipakuigala pamba panani ja lenge, kila kilebe makibomoligwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Malago na kupotekigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba atamite pikitombi cha Mizeituni, akinapunji ngabannyendela kukukiiya, ngabankonya, “Mutulengele ile yenje ipakube lii? Kiingi nike echikipakulaya kuika kwinu na kupela kwa mangobu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Mma maha makakoloigwaje na mundu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gambu ajingi mabapitila nukulongela kupetela kuliina lyango angweto balenga kila mundu, ‘Nenga nga Kilisto!’ Na angweto bapakaoya bandu ajingi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mpakujoanga nhwalo gwa ngondo na manjega ga ngondo, nambu makaechukangaje, gambu genia mpaka gapitile, nambu kupela kwene kubi tango. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kilambo chimwe kipakuputana na kilambo chenge, kingwana chimwe kipakuputana na kingwana chenge. Pamba na papa papakube na njala na nendemelo ya lutope. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Genia goa nga anda kutumbwa kwa kubinia kwa kupotola mwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Kabe bapampanga mpotakigwe nu ukomigwa. Ilambo yoa ipakunchimwanga magambu ga liina lyango. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kabe, ajingi bapakuleka mojo gwabe, bapakugalambuka nu kunchimwana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bapakupitila akalondoli nduu ba uwangi abapakaoyanga bandu ajingi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwa magambu ga kube ubaja nnyingi, kupalana kwa bandu kuba kupunguka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu ojwapakuimbalila mpaka kupela nga ojwapakomboka. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kabe Nhwalo Gwambone gu kingwana cha Nnoongo ubakutangachigwa padunia joa, kupala kuchalakicha ku bandu boa ba padunia, penia nga pukupakuika kupela.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga kukolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maluko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Pampa kukibona kilebe kibaja chikilengigwe na nnondoli Danieli kijemite paali pa Chwapi.” Ojwachoma amanya mana gakwe! <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Penia, ababi kukilambo cha Yudea batililange kwitombi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ojwabi pikinyanga cha nyumba jakwe akaulukaje kutola kilebe munyumba jakwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ojwabi kunng'onda akabujaje ukaja kutola lutando lwakwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bapakulaga akikege bina ndumbo na akinamama ababi ni ilemba eijonga machoba genia! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Munnyope Nnoongo kutila kwinu kukabe machoba ga malilije andaje lichoba lya kupomalelaje! <verse number="21" style="v"/>Gambu kingobu chenie kubakube na ukomo nkolongwa na gwanapitije tangu bapanganigwa bandu boa mpaka ngoe nupitije kabele. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Machoba genia gakabi nu kupunguyaje, akabije mundu jwajwoa ju komboka, nambu Nnoongo atekupunguya machoba genia kwa magambu ga bandu abapambuligwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Anda mundu annengi, ‘Nno, Kilisto Nkomboi abi pamba!’ Andaje ‘Abi papa!’ Makanhwaminije. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Gambu papakupiti makilisto buwangi na akalondoli buwangi. Na benia balayanga iingi ikoloikolo na yukuomongwa yakaoyanga bandu, ata kubandu abapambuligwe na Nnoongo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mpenekia, nannengelinge tangu nukupitije.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Anda bannengi, ‘Nnolanga, abi kupongoti!’ Makajendaje kwenio, andaje, ‘Nnolanga, akiite unyumba!’ Makanhwaminije, <verse number="27" style="v"/>Gambu andi njai pijimulika kuboka kumbwani mpaka kundonde, ngapipakube kuika kwakwe Mwana jwa Mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Paali apubi ntui, ngapagakongana matumbui.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuika kwa Mwana gwa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Kingobu tu kuboka pu kulaga kwenio, lichoba liba lubendu na mwei ung'alaje, ndondwa ibakugwe kuboka kumbengu, na makakala ga mbengu gabakutikatika. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuboka penia iingi ya Mwana jwa Mundu iba kubonekana kunani, penia makabi goa gapadunia gapakuguta, apagapa kummona Mwana jwa Mundu akaika mumaunde gu kunani, juna makakala na kibumo kikolongwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Jwombe apakakinga akapakachi bakwe kuboka kumbengu bina lipenga lina kujemba muno, bakongolange bandu abapambuligwe na Nnoongo, kuboka kujitumbwi dunia mpaka kujipei mbengu.</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo ga nkongo gwa nkojo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mukibolange kikilandanakia na nkongo ntini. Kingobu ndambi yakwe pitumbu kututuba maamba, mmanya kutenda mangobu ga mauno gaike. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nu uyo mangweto pampakibona ilebe yenie yoa ikapitilaga, mmanya Mwana jwa Mundu abi papipi kuika. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, lungolo londo lujebeleje nukupitilaje ilebe yenie. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mbengu na dunia maipeta, nambu malobe gango gapetaje ngu.</para>
  <para style="s">Abije jwalimanyi lichoba au kingobu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maluko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Nambu nhwalo gu lichoba andaje kingobu abije mundu ojwamanyi kiika lii, na akapakachi bukumbenguje na mwanaje, nambu Awawa jika jabe nga abamanyi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuika kwa Mwana jwa Mundu kupa kube andi kingobu cha Nuhu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Gambu machoba genia tango na ghalikaje bandu batela kulye na kunywe, akinalome na akikege kutolana nu kubutuyana mpaka Nuhu pajingila nkati mu Ntumbwi nkolongwa. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Bakibanga chebwe kiti kiba kupiti nike mpaka galika pijiika kajolanga boa. Yene ngipipakube Mwana jwa Mundu apapakuika. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie bandu abele ababi kung'onda, jumwe aitoligwa na jonge ailekigwa. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Akikege abena bibaganga bakayaga okole, jumwe aitoligwa na jonge ailekigwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Nkelukiange, gambu milimanyije lichoba lyabapakuika Angwana binu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Akola nyumba bakamanyi kutenda mwihi abakuika kabi bakelukiye akijilekiteje nyumba jakwe jibomoligwe. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Na yene mangweto uyo ntamanga maha gambu Mwana jwa Mundu abakuika kingobu changamanyika.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mpakachi juna mojo gwambone na jwanga mojo gwambone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulenga, “Meneke ojwabi mpakachi jwaaminike na jwambone na jwanga mwojo gwambone? Jwenio ananhota bakwe bammekite kachunga bandu bakwe bapegange chakulya kingobu echikipaligwa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mbaya mpakachi jwajo jubapakunkolela ananhota mundu akakamula genia! <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli, bapa kummeka mpakachi jwenio alolele ilebe yakwe yoa. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nambu anda mpakachi jwenio akilenge mwene, ‘Ananhota bango batenda kuchelwa kubuja,’ <verse number="49" style="v"/>Penia ngatumbu kaputa akapakachi ajabe, ngatumbu kunywe pamwe nabandu abalobela, <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ananhota mundu baika lichoba lyangamanyika na kingobu changamanyika. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ananhota bapa kunhweketa ipande nu kummeka pamwe na akabaja. Kwenio apakuguta nu kuyaga mino.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na akaenja komi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Kingobu chenie, Kingwana chu kumbengu kiba kulandana yene. Akaenja komi bapotolinge muli yabe ngabajenda kapoke akoano. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Akanhwano bakiba akajinga na akanhwano akambone. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Akajinga ngabapoto muli yabe, nambu bapotwije mauta gange. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nambu bina myojo ja mbone ngabapotola mauta muyupa pamwe na muli yabe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Magambu anahota ba mpapala bakachelwa kuika, akaenja boa bala ngabatumbu katopa lugono.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Kilo puwiku ngukujoanika na manjega, ‘Anahota bampapala batenda kuika! Nnyendange makapokele!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Akaenja boa ngabajimuka ngabaipangania imuli yabe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Akajinga bala ngabalenge bina mwojo gwambone bala, ‘Mutupegange mauta ginu machoko, gambu imuli ito itendakuimika.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nambu angweto bina myojo ja mbone ngabalengela, ‘Ije gututochaje twenga na mangweto. Mbaya nnyendange kuliduka makaemele mmene.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Penia, akaenja akajinga apabajenda kuemela mauta, akoano ngabaika. Na akaenja bala abakiba tela ngabajingalanga pamwe na bombe munyumba ja mpapala, na nniango ngujigaligwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Akaenja ajinga bala ngabaika, ngabakema, ‘Angwana, angwana, mutujogolele!’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu bombe ngabajanga, ‘Nannengelanga kweli, numanyije mangweto.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Penia, Yesu ngajomolela kulenga, ‘Nkelukiyange, magambu mmanyangitije lichoba lyenie lipakuika lii.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na akapakachi atatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Uyo Kingwana cha Nnoongo kipakube yene. Mundu jumwe ojwakapala kutyanga mwanja, ngabakema akapakachi bakwe, ngababeka bilolele ilebe yakwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngampe kila mundu tela na uwecho gwakwe, jumwe talanta nhwano yuloi na jonge talanta ibena na nyonjakea talanta jimwe. Kuboka penia ngatyanga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mpakachi ojwakapata talanta nhwano ngabeka uloi gwakwe kumundu ojwaucha ilebe ngapata nyonjekea talanta yenge nhwano. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na jonge jo uyo ojwakapata talanta ibena yuloi ngapata nyonjakea talanta yenge ibena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambu jwajo ojwakapata talanta jimwe ju uloi ngajenda, kuemba libomba pulutope, ngaiya talanta ja ananhota bakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Kuboka pa machoba majingi, ananhota benia ngababuja, ngabatama na akapakachi kakonya batei ni muloi gwabe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mpakachi ojwakapata talanta nhwano yuloi ngaika apotwile talanta yenge nhwano. Ngalenga, ‘Ananhota, makambe talanta nhwano. Nno mbatite nyonjakea talanta yenge nhwano.’ <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ananhota bakwe ngabannenge, ‘Chwapi, mapakachi mambone manhwaminike. Mmi kuaminika ku ilebe ichokoichoko, mbakunkamuya milolele ilebe ikolongwa. Nhwike nhwalalile pamwe na ananhota binu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Mpakachi ojwakapata talanta ibena yuloi ngaika, ngapanga talanta yenge ibena nyonjakea, akalenga, ‘Ananhota, makambe talanta ibena yuloi. Ntole talanta ibena yenge eijonjakike.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ananhota bakwe ngabannengela, ‘Tela, mapakachi mambone mina kuaminika. Mmi kuaminika ku ilebe ichokoichoko, mbankamuya ikolongwa. Nhwike nhwalalile pamwe na ananhota binu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nambu jwajo ojwakapata talanta jimwe juloi ngaika, ngalenga, ‘Ananhota, manyi mwe mamundu bukujundupa mwojo, mwe nhwuna pangapanda mbeju, nukonja pangamicha mbeju. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nganyogopa, nganhia uloi gwinu pae pulutope. Ntole chiumbile.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Ananhota bakwe ngabannenge, ‘Mwe mapakachi mabaja na makata! Mmanyi kutenda ne nhuna paali pangapanda mbeju, nu kutoteka pangamicha mbeju. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mpaligwa, kubeka uloi gwango kubenki, nane kabi ndoile ntaji gwango na nyonjakea! <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mampokange uloi gwenio makampe jwajo juna talanta komi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Gambu, mundu ojwakweti kilebe mapata nu kunnyonjakea. Nambu mundu jwanga kilebe, na chache chapemele akweti kipakutoligwa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na mpakachi ojo jwanga nyonjakea, mannekelange panja pulubendu! Kwenio apakuguta nukuyaga mino.’</para>
  <para style="s">Ukumu ja kupela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Mwana jwa Mundu ojwabi Nngwana papakuika na mu Kibumo chakwe na akapakachi bakwe boa ba Chwapi, penia atama pikitebu chakwe cha Kingwana cha Kibumo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bandu boa bikongananga nnongi jakwe, jwombe maibagana bandu benia ikuta ikuta, andi nchungi apabagana mambelele na mbui. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mababeka bandu abakamwile agapala Nnoongo kingonu chakwe cha kalelo na bandu akabaja kingonu chakwe cha kangeja. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Penia Angwana ngabalengela ababi kingonu chakwe cha kalelo, ‘Nhwikange mangweto mampatite kindimba na Awawa bango, mpokelange Kingwana echimpanganikigwe kuboke kupanganigwa kwa dunia. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Magambu nakiba na njala namangweto ngumbe chakulya, nakiba na nyota mangweto ngumbe mache, nakiba nageni namangweto ngumbokela, <verse number="36" style="v"/>nakiba makengele mangweto ngungwindia, nakiba natamwe mangweto ngunhwika kunola, nakiba kukipungo mangweto ngunhwika kundyangila.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Penia, bandu abakamwile agapala Nnoongo bajanga, ‘Angwana, lii tammona mmi nanjala natwe ngutumpe chakulya, na mmi na nyota natwe ngutunkenga mache? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lii tammona mmi mageni natwe ngutumpokela, na manga ngobo natwe ngutunkwindiya? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lii tammona mmi matamwe andaje mantabigwe natwe ngutuika kunnola?’ <verse number="40" style="v"/>Angwana mabijanga, ‘Nannenge kweli, kila kilebe chamankamulila jumwe jwa bamba akalongo bango achoko choko, mangamulila nenga.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Penia balengela ababi kingonu chakwe cha kangeja, ‘Mmokange nnongi jango mangweto mannanigwe na Nnoongo! Nnyendange kumwoto gwa machoba goa pangapela ogwapanganikigwa Mmaja na akapakachi bakwe. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nakiba na njala mangweto umbije chakulya. Nakiba na nyota mangweto umbije mache. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nakiba nageni mangweto umbokalingije, nakiba makengele, nambu mangweto ungwindiingije ngobo. Nakiba natamwe na nyigiligwe mukipungo, nambu mangweto maikije kunola.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Penia angweto ngabajanga, ‘Angwana, lii tammona mmi na njala au nyota, mmi mageni andaje manga ngobo, mmi matamwe andaje mannyigiligwe, nambu twe tuikije kunnyangata?’ <verse number="45" style="v"/>Angwana bijanga, ‘Nannenge kweli, kila pamakana ukamula ilebe ku jumwe jwa bandu akachoko choko, nkanangita kungamuli nenga.’ <verse number="46" style="v"/>Bamba bajabulanga kuhukumu janga pela. Nambu abakamula agapala Nnoongo benia bajabulanga kubwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela.”</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Machabuli ga kunkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu apajomola kubola genia goa, ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Mmanyangite kube gaigi machoba mabena kupakube na Mpapala gwa Pasaka, na Mwana jwa Mundu apangigwa ibe abambigwe munchalaba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie Akakung'i akolo na akananhota mundu ngabakongana pamwe panganya ja Kayafa ojwakiba Nkung'i nkolo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngabapanga ndela ja kunkamula Yesu bankome kukuiya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Nambu ngabalenga kile chimwe, chakakamuligwaje kingobu cha mpapala gwa Pasaka ukapitije ukomo kati ja bandu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apakaigwa mauta ku Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu akiba ku Betania, kachakwe Simoni, ojwakiba juna maloi, <verse number="7" style="v"/>amama bamwe abakiba na chupa echikitweli mauta ga kunungila gabei ngolongwa, nganhwikilila pamecha pala apakiba atamite akalya chakulya, ngannyitila mauta genia umutwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe apabalola genia ngabachimwa, ngabalenga, “Ganike kugatunia?” <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Mauta ganga kabi gauchigwe kubei ngolongwa, nu uloi gwene kape akaocho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya echibalongela, ngabalengela, “Mbona machumbuya amama bamba? Batei chwapi ni kile chambone kwango. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Akaocho mmi nabo machoba goa, nambu ne mbeje pamwe namangweto machoba goa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Amama bamba banyitile mauta ibe kumbanganikia kwa machiko gango. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli kutenda, padunia poa pupakutangachigwa Nhwalo Gwambone, kitendwa chenje chibatei amama aba kibakulongaligwa kakombake benia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ajeketela kunng'aluka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Penia Yuda Isikalioti, ojwakiba jumwe kati ja baba komi na abele, ngajenda kwa akakung'i akolo, <verse number="15" style="v"/>ngabalenge, “Mpakumbe kinii anda nang'alwike Yesu?” Ngabammalangi ipande selasini yuloi, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuboka kingobu chenie Yuda ngabe akapala ndela ju kunng'aluka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alye chakulya cha Pasaka pamwe na akinapunji bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lichoba lya kutumbula mpapala gwa mikate jangajela Kimela akinapunji ngabannyendela Yesu ngabankonya, “Mpala tukampanganikie ko Chakulya cha Pasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Nnyendange kunnyini kumundu jumwe, makannengele, ‘Aboli balenga, kingobu chango kiike, mbakulye Pasaka pamwe na akinapunji bango kachinu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabatenda andi Yesu apabalagila, ngabapangania mpapala gwa Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Piika kimuyo, Yesu ngatama kulye pamwe na akinapunji bakwe komi na abena. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Apabakiba bakalyaga, Yesu ngalenga, “Nannenge kweli, jumwe panakati jinu apakung'aluka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabaechuka muno, ngabatumbu kunkonya Yesu jumwe jumwe, “Angwana, bo nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Ojwapakulela nkate muntungati pamwe na nenga nga jwenio ojwapakung'aluka. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwana jwa Mundu mawa andi pagalenga Majandiko Gachwapi nhwalo gwa jwenio, nambu, kulaga mundu jwenio ojwapakunng'aluka Mwana jwa Mundu! Yakabi mbaya kwa mundu jwenio anda akabelwikije.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yuda ojwapala kunng'aluka, ngankonya, “Aboli! Bo, nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngalenga “Mwe nnengite.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ilyo ya Angwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Akakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pabakiba bakalyaga, Yesu ngatola nkate, ngannumba Nnoongo, ngaumetula, ngabape akinapunji bakwe nu kulenga, “Ntolange nnie, gongo nga mmele gwango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kabe ngatola kikombe, ngalumba, ngabape akalenga, “Nnywegange mmoa,” <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Jenje nga myai jango ejibeka kipola lilagano lya Nnoongo, myai ejichalakicha malagano ga bandu ajingi ibe balekekeigwe mabaja. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nannengelanga, nyweje kabele divai ja zabibu mpaka lichoba lyale apambakunywe nhyono pamwe na mangweto mu Kingwana cha Awabango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuboka pu kujemba nhwambo, ngabajenda kukitombi cha Mizeituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alenga Petulo apakungana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabalengela, “Kilo jenje ja lele, mmoa mwenga mpakutila nu kuneka ne, gambu Majandiko Gachwapi galenga, ‘Nnoongo alenga mbakunkoma nchungi, na kipenga cha mambelele kipakupwilikana.’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu kuboka pu kuyoka kwango, mbakunnongalela ku Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Petulo ngannenge Yesu, “Ata ikabi boa bannekangite, ne nannekaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Kweli nannengela, kilo ujenje tango nkokoloko nukubekaje, mpakungana patatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Petulo ngannengela, “Nengaje yenie ata anda napaligwe kuwe pamwe namwe nannekaje.”</para>
  <para style="p">Akinapunji bange bala ngabalenga uyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agongalela kung'onda gwa mikongo ku Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngajenda pamwe na akinapunji bakwe paali apakemigwa Getisemani, ngabalenge, “Ntamange pamba ne nyenda papa kugongalela.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ngantola Petulo pamwe ni ingota ibena ya Zebedayo, ngatumbula kuechuka na kube na nambwele, <verse number="38" style="v"/>Penia ngabalengela, “Mbi na kuwechuka kukolongwa umwojo papipi nu kuwe. Ntamange pamba nkeluyange pamwe na ne.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ngajenda nnongi kachoko, ngagwe manguku, ngagongalela, “Awabango andaiotwile kikombe chenje chambete, nambu ikabe anda apambala neje, ila apampala mwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngababuji akinapunji bakwe akatatu bala, ngabakole bagochilinge, ngannenge Petulo, “Mboni makangweto nchipulinge kube mio pamwe nane ata lisaa limwe? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nkelukiange nukugongalela kupala makalondoigwaje. Uhuke kupala kutenda agapala Nnoongo nambu makakala ga mundu kuotoje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ngajenda kabe mala ja pabele ngagongalela, “Awawa bango, anda iotwile kikombe chikumboteka kipete panga nywe nenga, nambu agampala gakamuligwe.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ngabajendela kabele, ngabakolelanga bagochalinge, gambu mio gabe gakiba na lugono.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yesu ngabaleka, ngajenda kabele kugongalela mala ja patatu kwa malobe ugaga. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kabe ngabajendela akinapunji bala, ngabalengela, “Bo, mmi tango makagolokanga nu kupomolela? Nnolange! Kingobu chene kiike, na Mwana jwa Mundu makamuigwa mumaboko ga bandu abakamu mabaja. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nnyinukange tujende. Atendakuika ojwapakung'aluka!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kupukiligwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba tango akalongela nabo, kingobucho ngaika Yuda, jumwe kati ja akinapunji komi na abele. Ngalongwana nabo bandu ajingi bina mapanga na imbonga. Abakiba batumigwe na akakung'i akolo na akananhota ba bandu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mundu ojwapala kunng'aluka Yesu, akiba tayali aulaite kiingi nkengeni gwenio kulenga, “Mundu ojumbakunkumbatila ngajwenio. Mampukilange!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yuda ngaunhwegele Yesu nu kulenga, “Aboli, kunchelile,” penia ngankumbatila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Aganja, nkamule echinhwiki ukamula.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabaika kumpukila Yesu nu kummekanga mumakakala. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Jumwe ja abakiba pamwe na Yesu ngatondabeya luboko, ngaucholomola upanga gwakwe, ngamputa mpakachi jwa Nkung'i Nkolo, ngaunheketa lichikilo. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu nganengela, “Mmuye upanga gwinu muala, gambu jwajoa ojwaputana ku upanga, mawa nu upanga. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Bo, mmanyangiteje kube kabi nhotwi kajopa Awawa bango nabombe kingobu uchenje kabibanetile kikuta kikolongwa cha bandu komi na mabele cha akapakachi ba Nnoongo? <verse number="54" style="v"/>Nambu ipakulenganila bo Majandiko Gachwapi eilenga kube nga apaipaligwa kube?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yesu ngaulenge nkengeni gwa bandu, “Bo, unhwikilinge kumbukila kwa mapanga na imbonga anda ne napoki? Machoba goa nakiba Munyumba ja Nnoongo nakabola, na umbukalingeje. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Nambu ganga goa gakamuligwe ibe Majandiko ga alondoli ba Nnoongo galenganile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Penia akinapunji boa ngabanneka, ngabatilanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nnongi ja akolongwa ba Libalacha lya Akayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maluko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Bandu benia ababampukila Yesu ngabampeleka kachakwe Kayafa, Nkung'i Nkolongwa, okwabakongana aboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na akananhota. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Petulo ngankengama kutaali, mpaka mu uwa ja nyumba ja Nkung'i Nkolongwa, ngajingi unyumba pamwe na akalendei aibone ilebe pipakube. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Akakung'i Akolongwa na Libalacha lya Akayahudi ngabajiga kupala malobe guwangi ibe bankome Yesu, <verse number="60" style="v"/>nambu bapatangiteje lilobe lyalyoa, na bandu ajingi ngabaika ngabalenga malobe guwangi kujwenio. Ngabajomolela kuika bandu abena, <verse number="61" style="v"/>ngabalenga, “Mundu ojo alengita kutenda, ‘Anhotwile kujibomo Nyumba ja Nnoongo nu kuchenga kabena kwa machoba matatu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Nkung'i Nkolongwa ngajema, ngankonya Yesu, “Bo, nnyangaje lilobe? Bandu aba batenda kunkopakea?” <verse number="63" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngatama nuu. Nkung'i Nkolongwa ngannenge, “Nnapile ku Nnoongo ojwabi mmomi anda mwe nga Kilisto Nkomboi, Mwana jwa Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v"/>Yesu ngannyanga jwenio, “Elo mwe nnengite. Nambu nannengelanga mmoa, kutumbu ngoe mamammona Mwana jwa Mundu atamite kingonu cha kalelo cha Nnoongo juna uwecho, akaika mumaunde gu kumbengu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Penia, Nkung'i Nkolongwa ngajwepula ngobo yakwe, ngalenga, “Atekuntukana Nnoongo! Tupaije akachaili! Nnyoaninge apantukana Nnoongo! <verse number="66" style="v"/>Mangweto nhwachangabo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Angweto ngabannyanga, “Akweti malemwa apaligwa kuwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Kabe ngubunhwuni mata kumio, ngabamputa makopi. Bange kongo bakamputa makopi, <verse number="68" style="v"/>ngabalenga, “Kilisto mutulengele beneke, abamputite!”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maluko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Petulo akiba atamite panja kuua. Penia, mpakachi jumwe munkege ngannyendela, ngalenga, “Mwe uyo makiba pamwe na Yesu juku Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Petulo ngakana nnongi ja boa akalenga, “Manyije echinnongela,” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Apakiba akapita paniango, mpakachi jonge munkege ngammona, ngabalengela abakiba penia, “Mundu jwajo akiba pamwe na Yesu juku Nazaleti.” <verse number="72" style="v"/>Petulo ngakana nukulenga, “Napila yene numanyije mundu jwenio!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Mwenakandaye kachoko, bandu abakiba penia ngabannyendela Petulo. Ngabannengela, “Kweli, mwe nga nabamwe kati ja angweto, gambu kilonge chinu kibonekana mwe mmoke ku Galilaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>Penia Petulo ngatumbu kulapila kulenga, Nnoongo anhukumule anda nonge uwangi! “Numanyije mundu jwenio!”</para>
  <para style="p">Kingobu tu nkokoloko ngabeka, <verse number="75" style="v"/>Petulo ngakombakela malobe galenga Yesu, “Tango nkokoloko nukubekaje, mpakungana patatu umanyije ne.” Ngapita panja ngaguta muno.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bampeleka kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maluko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pukuchaga, akakung'i akolongwa boa na akinanhota ngababeka machabuli gu kupala kunkoma Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngabantaba ntondolo, ngabampeleka kunkamuya Pilato, nkolongwa jwa nkoa ojwachaguligwe na kilongoi jwa Loma.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiu cha Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Itendwa 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Penia Yuda jwenio ojwang'alukaga, palola kube Yesu bunhukumwile, ngaganwa, ngababuki akakung'i akolo na akinanhota ipande salasini yuloi yela. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngabalengela, “Ndekulemwa kummeka mundu jwanga malemwa akomigwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu bombe ngabalenga, “Twe genia gutupata bo? Genia ginu mmene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yuda ngaulekela uloi gola munyumba ja Nnoongo, ngapita panja, ngajabula ngakikongela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo ngabatola uloi gola, ngabalenga “Ipaligweje kubeka munkoba gwa nyumba ja Nnoongo kwa magambu uloi gwa ukoma mundu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngabalagana, ngabaemela nng'onda gwa mmombi pabe paali pa kuchiki akageni. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mpaka lele nng'onda gwenio ukemigwa, “Nng'onda gwa Myai.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Penia malobe ga nnondoli Yelemia ngagalenganila, “Ngabatola ipande makomi matatu ya uloi kulenganila na jwajo jubammeka bei bandu ba Kuisilaeli, <verse number="10" style="v"/>ngabaemela kwa uloi gwenio nng'onda, anda Angwana apabanagila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pilato ankonnya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maluko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ngabannyemeka nnongi ja nkolongwa jwa Nkoa. Penia, ngabankonya, “Bo, mwe nga Mangwana ba Akayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajanga, “Mwe nnengite.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu akakung'i akolongwa na akananhota apabakiba bakantakiana, ajangitije lilobe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yene Pilato ngankonya, “Bo, mpetakujoaje matakiano genia goa agabapia kwinu mwenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ajangitije ata lilobe limwe, ata akolongwa ba Nkoa ngabaomongwa muno.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bunhukumu kuwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lwakiba lukobo lwabe kingobu cha mpapala gwa Pasaka akolongwa ba Nkoa kaleke Akayahudi mundu jumwe ojwatabigwe ojwabampailinge. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie akiba ojwatabigwe jumwe, lina lyakwe Yesu Balaba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yene, bandu apabakongananga pamwe, Pilato ngabakonyanga, “Mpalanga nanneke jwako kati ja abele bamba, Balaba andaje Yesu ojwakemigwa Kilisto Nkomboi?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Alenga yene gambu amanyi kibola kutenda bannetanga kwakwe magambu ga bwiu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilato apakiba atamite pakitebu cha hukumu, anhana mundu ngabapelekela chalamu, “Makankamwa kilebeje mundu jwambone jwenio, gambu lele ndekulaga muno mumaloto magambu jakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu akakung'i akolongwa na akananhota ngabakwelekea bandu bannyope Balaba ajogoligwe na Yesu akomigwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nkolongwa jwa Nkoa ngakonya, “Jwako kati ja abele bamba ojwampala nanneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabannyanga, “Balaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilato ngabakonyanga, “Lele, nantendibo Yesu ojwakemigwa Kilisto Nkomboi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Boa ngabalenga, “Abambigwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pilato ngakonya, “Kwa nike? Atei ubaja gani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Angweto ngabayanga kulenga kanonoya, “Abambigwe panchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pilato apamanya kube aotwaje chachoa na kijonga kitela kutumbula, ngatola mache, ngakuya maboko nnongi ja bandu, ngalenga, “Ne ngwetije ligambo nhwalo gwa kiu cha mundu jonjo, kwale mmene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabalenga, “Myai jakwe jibe panani ja mitwe jito na panani ja mitwe ja ingota ito!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Penia Pilato ngannekekea Balaba kuboka kukipungo, nambu Yesu ngabakamuya aputigwe iboko na manjolinjoli na abambigwe panchalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli gammeka nhwenyo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maluko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Penia manjolinjoli ga Pilato ngagampeleka Yesu panganya ja boma, nkengeni gwoa ngukongana kuntindiki jwombe. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ngabanhwula ngobo yakwe, ngabankwindiya ngobo ya kingwana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ngabapota ulembalemba gwa miba na ngabankwindiya umutwe, uyo ngabammekela nnai puluboko lwakwe lwa kalelo. Ngabakilikitila nnongi jakwe na ngabammeke nhwenyo bakalenga, “Kunchelile Angwana ba Akayahudi!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ngubunhuni mata, ngubuto nnai ngabamputi umutwe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuboka pu kummeke nhwenyo, ngubunhwula lijou lela na ngabankwindiya ngobo yakwe, kuboka penia ngabampeleka kummamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abambigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Apabakiba bakajenda, ngabankolela mundu jumwe liina lyakwe Simoni, mundu jwa kilambo cha Kulene, ngabannenge mpoto nchalaba gwa Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Apabaikanga paali apakemigwa Goligota, mana gakwe, “Paali pi Kitongo cha mutwe,” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ngabampe divai kutindigana na kile kibaba ntela gukupoya kubinia. Nambu Yesu apapaya ngakana kunywe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ngabammamba, uyo ngababagana ngobo yakwe kukubeka kiumbuumbu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuboka pa genia ngabatamanga, ngabannendela. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Panani ja mutwe gwakwe panchalaba ngababeka kibao echibaandike, “Jonjo nga Yesu, Nngwana jwa Akayahudi.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Akapoki abena ngababambigwa uyo pamwe na Yesu, jumwe kingonu cha kangeja na jonge kingonu cha kalelo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Bandu abakapeta penia ngabantukana Yesu nukutikatika mitwe jabe kulenga, <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Mwe! Nnengita nhotwije kujibomola nyumba ja Nnoongo nukuchenga kwa machoba matatu? Ngoe mikikombole mmene. Anda mwe nga Mamwana jwa Nnoongo, nhuluke panchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na akananhota uyo ngabammeke nhwenyo bakalenga, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Ngabakombo bange, nambu kukikombola mwene kuotwaje! Jwombe konda Nngwana jwa Akasilaeli! Anda ngoe auluke panchalaba, natwe matunhwamina. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nganhyobalela Nnoongo nukulenga eti jwombe nga Mwana jwa Nnoongo, Nyeme twetulole anda Nnoongo apaile kunkombola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ababambigwa pamwe ngabantukana uyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awe panchalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ikiba saa sita nalumu mpaka saa tisa kimuyo, lubendu ngulutanda kilambo choa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Apaika saa tisa Yesu ngaguta kulilobe likolongwa, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Mana gakwe, “Nnoongo jwango, Nnoongo, jwango mboni undekuneka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Bandu bange abajemangita penia abannyoanga jwenio ngabalenga, “Ankema Eliya.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Jumwe kati jabe ngabutuka, ngatola litonji na ngalichwika musiki, ngalitabali munnai ngantondobeke Yesu anywe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Bange ngabalenga, “Nyemetulole anda Eliya maika kunkombola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu ngaguta kabena kanonoya, ngajomoka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Panjia ja nkati ja Nyumba ja Nnoongo elibagina pa Chwapi ja Nnoongo ngijipachuka ipande ibena kuboka kunani mpaka pae. Nnema ngulendemela na mabwe ngagapachuka, <verse number="52" style="v"/>makabuli ngagajogoka na bandu nduu bachwapi ba Nnoongo abawile ngabayoka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Na bombe, kuboka pa kuyoka kwakwe Yesu kuboka kwa abawile, ngabapita mumakabuli na ngabaika mukilambo cha Chwapi Kuyelusalemu na ngababonekana na bandu nduu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kilongoi jwa akalenda ba Loma na manjolinjoli agakiba gakannendela Yesu apabalola kulendemela kwa lutope na ilebe eipitile yela, ngabajogopa muno, ngabalenga, “Kweli mundu jonjo akiba Mwana jwa Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Paali penia pakiba na akikege ajingi bakalolanga kwa kutaali. Benia nga abankengama Yesu kuboke ku Galilaya bakantumikia jwombe. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kati jabe akiba Maliamu Magidalena na Maliamu amama ba Yakobo na Yusufu, pamwe na amama ba ingota ya Zebedayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Machiko ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Apaikiba kimuyo, ngaika mundu jumwe juna uloi kuboke Alimatayo, liina lyakwe Yusufu. Jwombe uyo akiba napunji jwa Yesu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Ngannyendela Pilato, ngajopa bampe mmele gwa Yesu. Pilato ngaamulicha bampe. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yusufu ngautola mmele gola, ngaubiligila chanda ejibi chwapi, <verse number="60" style="v"/>ngaubeka nkati ja likabuli lyakwe liyono elikiba liembigwe piliganga. Penia ngalipilimbia libwe likolongwa nnongi ja nniango gu likabuli, ngajabula. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Maliamu Magidalena na Maliamu jonge bakiba batamangite kulilolake likabuli.</para>
  <para style="s">Akalenda pilikabuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Malabo jakwe, lichoba elikengima elikiba lya Kupomolela, akakung'i akolo na Mafalisayo ngabannyendelela Pilato, <verse number="63" style="v"/>Ngabalenga, “Ananhota, tubiukombokela kutenda jwajo nhwangi pakiba mmomi alenga, ‘Kuboka pa machoba matatu mahyoka.’ <verse number="64" style="v"/>Ku yene nhwamuliche likabuli lilendeligwe mpaka lichoba lya tatu ibe akinapunji bakwe bakannyibaje na kalenge bandu kutenda ayokite. Nhwangi gwa kupela gongo upakube mmaja muno kupeta gwago gwa kutumbula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Pilato ngabalengela, “Aja, nkweti akalendei, nnyendanga makalendele apanhwotwile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Yenie ngabajendanga, ngabalilendela likabuli, ngabalimatila libwe lela na kaleka penia akalendei bakalenda.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maluko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-20">Yohana 20:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka pi Lichoba li Kupomolela, papipi nu kuche gi lichoba lya jumapili, Maliamu Magidalena na Maliamu jonge ngabajendanga kulola likabuli lela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kingobucho ngukupitila kulendemela kukolongwa kwa lutope, mpakachi jwa Angwana ngauluka kuboka kumbengu, ngalipilimbia libwe lela, ngalitamila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Abonekana anda njai na ngobo yakwe yakiba nhuu mbuu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Akalendei bilikabuli lela ngabalendemela kwa mbwele ngolongwa, na ngababe anda batekuwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambu Mpakachi jola ngabalenge akikege bala, “Mangweto makajogopaje! Manyi kutenda mampalanga Yesu ojwabambigwe munchalaba. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Abije pamba ayokite andi palengaga. Nhwikange nnole paali pabammekita. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nyendange chokwe makalengelange akinapunji bakwe ‘Kube ayokite kuboka kwa abawile, na ngoe annongolela kwako ku Galilaya, kwenio mamammona!’ Aja, ne tayali nannengalinge.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kongo bakajogopa nu kualalila, akikege benia ngababoka chokwe pilikabuli ngababe na mbwele muno ngababutuka kujenda kalenge akinapunji bakwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kingobucho, Yesu ngakongana nabo, ngabalenge, “Nnumbalile.” Akikege benia ngabannyendelela, ngabakilikitila nnongi jakwe, ngabakamula makongono gabe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Makajogopaje! Nnyendange makalengela akalonga bango bajendange Ku Galilaya na kwenio mabakamona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Malobe ga akalendei ba likabuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Akikege bala apabakiba bakajabulaga, akalendei bange ba likabuli lela ngabajenda kunnyini kulenga kila kilebe kwa akakung'i nhwalo gwa ilebe yoa eipitile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngabakongana pamwe na akanhota na kuboka pa kulongelanga, ngabape akalendei bala uloi nduu, <verse number="13" style="v"/>bakalenga, “Mangweto nnenga yene, ‘Akinapunji bakwe ngabaika kilo kuujiba mmele gwakwe twe ogutakiba tugochile lugono’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na anda Akolongwa ba Loma bamanyi kilechenje na twe matulongela nabo mpaka tulole kube mangweto mpatangaje malola.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Akalendei bala ngabautola uloi gola, ngabakamwa anda pababoligwe. Nhwalo gwenio ujoanike kati ja Akayahudi mpaka lele.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapitila akinapunji bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Itendwa 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Akinapunji komi na jumwe bala ngabajendanga ku Galilaya kukitombi echabalagila Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apabammona, ngabanng'ongalela, nambu bange bakiba na mbwele. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu ngaika papipi, ngabalengela, “Mbatite kinala choa kumbengu nu kudunia. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nnyendange, makabeke bandu boa babe akinapunji bango, makabatichanga kuliina lya Awawa na lya Mwana na lya Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mabolange ukamula Malagilo bandu ilambo yoa na makabi goa aganampilangite. Nenga mbi pamwe namangweto machoba goa pangapela, mpaka pijibakupela dunia.”</para>
</usx>
